	(65, 10, 'I was eligible for private account so this was for upgrading my account to private account.\n\nBut one thing i dont understand why there is need to open new account and not upgraded existing. I already had wealth account, to upgrade also again opened wealth account. I really dont understand this logic. I dont even understand this logic.\n\n ', 'Service Delays / Account Issues', 'Negative', 'Medium', 'Frustration', 'The customer is confused about the need to open a new account instead of upgrading the existing one.', 'Clarify the account upgrade process and communicate the rationale behind it to customers. Consider simplifying the process to enhance customer understanding and satisfaction.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(66, 9, 'Overall was good better you can expand your branches and cc maintainece charge is little high ', 'Charges, Fees, Balance Requirements', 'Neutral', 'Medium', 'Disappointment', 'The customer noted that while the overall experience was good, the maintenance charges were perceived as high.', 'Review the maintenance charges in comparison to competitors and consider adjustments if necessary. Communicate the value of services provided to justify the charges to customers.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(67, 10, 'secure documents scanned by agent device. I\'m not sure if photos taken from agent devices are secure ', 'Service Dissatisfaction', 'Negative', 'Medium', 'Fear', 'The customer expressed concern about the security of documents scanned by agents.', 'Enhance security measures for document handling and communicate these measures clearly to customers. Consider providing reassurance through educational materials about data protection practices.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(68, 9, 'This is really most upgraded system I have used in opening the account No changes required ', 'App / Online Banking related', 'Positive', 'High', 'Satisfied', 'The customer praised the upgraded system used for account opening, indicating no changes are required.', 'Continue to invest in technology upgrades to maintain customer satisfaction. Regularly solicit feedback on new systems to ensure they meet customer needs and expectations.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
