	(73, 10, 'Overall experience was great, specially the Onboarding was smooth & relationship manager Yash Chavda have been very helpful for opening my NRE account, He told me each and everything very specifically & made me understand the benefits.', 'Seamless Account opening', 'Positive', 'High', 'Satisfied', 'The customer had a great overall experience, especially with the onboarding process.', 'Continue to streamline the onboarding process and ensure that relationship managers are well-trained. Collect feedback from new customers to identify areas for further improvement.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(74, 0, 'Bola kuch aur account open hone ke baad kuch aur bola mene account closed karne ke liye bool diya', 'Account Closure Request', 'Negative', 'High', 'Disappointment', 'The customer feels misled about the account opening process.', 'Review the communication provided to customers regarding account opening. Ensure that all information is clear and consistent to avoid misunderstandings that could lead to account closures.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(75, 10, 'Overall good experience and quick process', 'Competence Staff', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'The customer reports an overall good experience with a quick process.', 'Maintain the efficiency of your processes and continue to seek ways to improve speed without sacrificing quality. Regularly solicit feedback to ensure customer satisfaction remains high.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(76, 9, 'Very good banking thank you ? \n', 'Satisfied Customer', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'The customer expresses gratitude for the banking service.', 'Encourage customers to share their positive experiences on social media or review platforms. This can enhance your brand\'s reputation and attract new customers.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
