	(79, 10, 'I an happy with the current process\n', 'Satisfied Customer', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'The customer expresses happiness with the current process, indicating a positive experience.', 'Continue to maintain the current processes that are working well. Regularly gather feedback to ensure that customer satisfaction remains high. Consider sharing success stories to reinforce positive perceptions.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(80, 10, 'For a Student monthly average balance of RS.25000 is very cumbersome.It should be Rs.5000.00 if possible.', 'Charges, Fees, Balance Requirements', 'Positive', 'High', 'Frustration', 'The customer finds the monthly average balance requirement cumbersome and suggests a lower amount.', 'Review the current monthly average balance requirements and consider adjusting them based on customer feedback. Communicate any changes clearly to customers to enhance their experience. Additionally, provide alternative options for customers who may struggle with the current requirements.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(81, 9, 'Abhi to koi kami ni hai abhi abhi to join Kiya Hai abhi tk sab kuch achaa hai jaise sab jahg hotaa hai aage k liyee dekhte hai', 'Satisfied Customer', 'Neutral', 'Low', 'Neutral', 'The customer is currently satisfied but is cautious about future experiences.', 'Ensure that the customer remains engaged by providing regular updates and support. Encourage them to share their experiences as they continue to use the service. Monitor their feedback closely to address any potential issues proactively.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(82, 10, 'Ha ji Hamare Sahar me branch nahi hai bahut dur Jana padta hai please all pin code open branch ', 'Branch Access & Location related', 'Negative', 'High', 'Frustration', 'The customer is frustrated due to the lack of a nearby branch, making access difficult.', 'Consider expanding branch locations or enhancing online services to accommodate customers in remote areas. Communicate any plans for new branches or improved online services to affected customers. Additionally, explore partnerships with local businesses to provide alternative access points.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(83, 10, 'Smooth process nothing else required ', 'Satisfied Customer', 'Positive', 'Low', 'Satisfied', 'The customer is content with the smoothness of the process and feels no additional changes are necessary.', 'Maintain the current processes that are yielding positive feedback. Regularly check in with customers to ensure that their needs continue to be met. Consider implementing a feedback loop to capture ongoing satisfaction levels.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(84, 9, 'Yes pathankot deepak idfc bank good service ', 'Happy with Service', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'The customer appreciates the good service provided by the bank.', 'Recognize and reward staff for delivering excellent service to encourage continued high performance. Share positive feedback with the team to boost morale. Consider implementing a customer referral program to leverage satisfied customers.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(85, 5, 'Do not false claim online account opening for nris. \n\nOpened Zerodha trading account and demat account semi online without any attest \n\nBut bank account needs attest which is strange ', 'Account Opening Experience', 'Negative', 'High', 'Frustration', 'The customer is frustrated with the discrepancy in account opening processes for NRIs.', 'Review the account opening process for NRIs to identify inconsistencies and streamline the experience. Provide clear communication regarding the requirements for different account types. Consider offering dedicated support for NRIs to assist with their specific needs.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(86, 0, 'My Imtiyaz Ali has cheated me by issuing me a credit card instead of WOW forex card.', 'Credit Card related', 'Negative', 'High', 'Frustration', 'The customer feels cheated due to receiving the wrong type of card.', 'Investigate the issue with the credit card issuance and ensure that the customer is provided with the correct card promptly. Implement checks to prevent similar issues in the future. Offer an apology and compensation to the customer to rebuild trust.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(87, 10, 'I happy with idfc first bank and their staff \n', 'Competence Staff', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'The customer expresses happiness with IDFC First Bank and its staff.', 'Continue to foster a positive environment for staff to ensure high levels of customer satisfaction. Encourage staff to maintain strong relationships with customers. Consider gathering testimonials from satisfied customers to promote the bank\'s services.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(88, 1, 'Mobile number is not updated ', 'Digital Process Issue', 'Negative', 'High', 'Frustration', 'The customer is experiencing issues with their mobile number not being updated.', 'Address the mobile number update issue promptly to ensure the customer can access all services. Review the process for updating customer information to identify any gaps. Communicate with the customer to confirm the update and provide reassurance.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(89, 7, 'Data fed by the agent, while opening the account, should be shown to the potential customer for correctness.', 'Account Opening Experience', 'Neutral', 'Medium', 'Frustration', 'Customers feel that the data provided during account opening should be verified for correctness.', 'Implement a verification step during the account opening process where customers can review their information. This will help reduce errors and enhance customer satisfaction. Additionally, consider providing a confirmation email summarizing the details entered.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(90, 10, 'I wanted to take a moment to express my heartfelt appreciation for the exceptional service provided by Pavan Kumar Gupta during my interactions with IDFC First Bank\'s Navsari branch. His professionalism, promptness, and willingness to assist have made a significant difference in my banking experience.\n\nThanks to his dedication and commitment to delivering outstanding service, I have been impressed by the excellence he consistently demonstrates. In fact, his service and commitment have been so impressive that I have moved all my relationships from other banks to IDFC First Bank, Navsari.\n\nThank you for having such a valuable member on your team.\n\nBest Regards,', 'Happy with Service', 'Positive', 'High', 'Satisfied', 'A customer expressed deep appreciation for the exceptional service provided by a specific staff member, leading to a shift of all their banking relationships to IDFC First Bank.', 'Recognize and reward employees like Pavan Kumar Gupta for their outstanding service. Share their success stories internally to motivate other staff members. Consider implementing a customer feedback program to continuously gather insights on service quality.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(91, 10, 'Good ?? banking  IDFC FIRST BANK', 'Satisfied Customer', 'Positive', 'Low', 'Satisfied', 'A customer expressed positive sentiments about their banking experience with IDFC First Bank.', 'Continue to maintain high service standards and encourage customers to share their positive experiences. Consider creating a referral program to leverage satisfied customers for new business.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(92, 10, 'Itâ€™s a good start - now awaiting experience of customer service and support.', 'Customer Support & Follow-up', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Neutral', 'A customer is optimistic about their banking experience but is awaiting further interaction with customer service.', 'Follow up with the customer after their initial experience to ensure their needs are met. Provide them with information on how to access customer support easily. This proactive approach can enhance customer loyalty.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(93, 10, 'Excellent service compared to other bank\n', 'Happy with Service', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Frustration', 'Customers are frustrated with the lack of options for lower balance accounts at branches.', 'Evaluate the current account offerings and consider introducing a 10k Monthly Average Balance Account option at branches. Communicate these options clearly to customers to avoid confusion and dissatisfaction.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(94, 10, 'Most of the branches doesn\'t offer opening 10k Monthly Avg Balance Account instead they tell you to open 25k one.. So it\'s better if the branches offer 10k variant offline also..', 'Charges, Fees, Balance Requirements', 'Negative', 'High', 'Frustration', 'A customer had a negative experience with the online account opening process, feeling it was a waste of time.', 'Review the online account opening process to identify and eliminate any bottlenecks. Consider providing a form for interested customers to express their intent before they start the online process. This can help streamline the experience and reduce frustration.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(95, 10, 'Please remove the online account opening option from web or application. I wasted my an hour on this.\nAlso uf you want to get the details of who all want to open account online , you can provide form to get the details and then bank can contact the person interested to open the account.', 'Service Delays / Account Issues', 'Negative', 'High', 'Satisfied', 'Customers are pleased with the service and staff at the bank.', 'Continue to invest in staff training and development to maintain high service levels. Regularly gather feedback from customers to ensure that staff performance meets expectations and to identify areas for improvement.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(96, 10, 'Best service and excellent staff\n', 'Happy with Service', 'Positive', 'Low', 'Neutral', 'A customer had a smooth and efficient experience with no suggestions for improvement.', 'Maintain the current level of service and consider conducting regular surveys to ensure that customer satisfaction remains high. Encourage customers to provide feedback even when they are satisfied, as this can help identify potential areas for enhancement.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(97, 10, '"overall, the experience was smooth and efficient. The staff was helpful and explained everything clearly. No suggestions for improvement at this time."', 'Competence Staff', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'Customers appreciate the online services and transparency of IDFC Bank.', 'Continue to enhance online services and maintain transparency in operations. Regularly update customers on new features and rewards to keep them engaged and satisfied with the banking experience.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(98, 2, 'How many times I have to request to complete the process of Joint Account ', 'Account Opening Experience', 'Negative', 'High', 'Frustration', 'The customer is repeatedly frustrated with the slow process of completing a joint account request.', 'Streamline the joint account opening process to reduce the number of requests needed from customers. Implement a tracking system that allows customers to see the status of their application in real-time. Additionally, provide clear communication on expected timelines to manage customer expectations.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(99, 10, 'IDFC ???? ??? ??? ??? ?? . ?????? ???? ?????? ???? ???? ???? ??? ?? ????????? ???? ?? ??? ???.\n??? ?? ?? ???? ???? ???? ??? ??? ????? ???? ??. ??? ???????? ???? ?? ??? ???? ???? ? ???.???? ?????? idfc ??? ?????.', 'Generic', 'Neutral', 'High', 'Frustration', 'The customer expresses confusion and dissatisfaction with the service provided, indicating a language barrier or lack of clarity.', 'Enhance customer support by providing multilingual assistance and clearer communication regarding account services. Consider training staff to better handle diverse customer needs and ensure that all communications are easily understandable.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(100, 9, '1.Account open after some time deposit minimum balance \n2.please give a time of minimum 5 days for account open at the same time deposit minimum balance ', 'Charges, Fees, Balance Requirements', 'Neutral', 'Medium', 'Disappointment', 'The customer is disappointed with the lengthy account opening process, especially when a minimum balance is required.', 'Review the account opening process to ensure it is efficient and customer-friendly. Consider offering a more flexible timeline for account opening that accommodates customer needs, especially for those who are depositing minimum balances.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(101, 5, 'I have been opened demat account for trading but you have not provided the clint master up to date I have open the account in  condition with your staff Mrs Nandani singh said me that  I will provide you clint master immediately without fail but your staff failed to provid if it is not possible then I will try to cancel all the account SA/ Demat account .this is your staff responsibility who is careless after opening SA\nThans ??\n', 'Agent Behaviour', 'Negative', 'High', 'Frustration', 'The customer is frustrated with the lack of timely updates regarding their demat account and the perceived carelessness of staff.', 'Implement a system for timely updates on account status and ensure that staff are held accountable for their commitments. Regular training sessions should be conducted to emphasize the importance of customer service and follow-through.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(102, 10, 'Mere ko account kholne mein achcha Laga aur vahan ke account kholne wali mam ka nature', 'Seamless Account opening', 'Positive', 'Low', 'Satisfied', 'The customer had a positive experience with the account opening process and appreciated the staff\'s nature.', 'Continue to foster a positive customer service environment by recognizing and rewarding staff who provide excellent service. Gather feedback from satisfied customers to identify best practices that can be shared across the team.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(103, 9, 'Very good experience. Account opening process very quick. Good and professional bank representative. ', 'Seamless Account opening', 'Positive', 'Low', 'Satisfied', 'The customer had a very good experience with a quick account opening process and professional representatives.', 'Maintain the current standards of service that led to this positive experience. Consider gathering testimonials from satisfied customers to use in marketing efforts to attract new clients.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(104, 10, '"Agent Kuzhandaisamy from the Nanganallur branch was polite and maintained a respectful demeanor throughout the account opening process. I truly experienced digital banking at its finest. While I appreciate being an investor with IDFC Bank, I believe the minimum account balance of â‚¹25K is quite high. Making it more affordableâ€”perhaps around â‚¹5Kâ€”would be beneficial for low-income individuals and could certainly attract more customers.', 'Branch Access & Location related', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Disappointment', 'The customer appreciates the service but feels the minimum balance requirement is too high for low-income individuals.', 'Reassess the minimum balance requirement to make banking more accessible for low-income customers. Consider introducing tiered account options that cater to different financial capabilities, which could help attract a broader customer base.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(105, 10, 'All process is good \n', 'Satisfied Customer', 'Positive', 'Low', 'Satisfied', 'The customer found the overall process to be good.', 'Continue to monitor customer satisfaction levels and maintain the quality of service that led to this positive feedback. Regularly solicit feedback to identify areas for improvement and ensure that the good experiences are consistent.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(106, 10, 'Video KYC bahut badhiya support Kiya team ne', 'KYC / Video KYC Process related', 'Positive', 'Low', 'Satisfied', 'The customer appreciated the support received during the Video KYC process.', 'Highlight the success of the Video KYC process in marketing materials to showcase the bank\'s commitment to customer support. Consider expanding this service and training staff to ensure consistent quality across all customer interactions.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
