	(110, 10, 'Excellent Bank with reliability. Must avail services of  everyone ', 'Happy with Service', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'The customer finds the bank reliable and recommends its services to others.', 'Leverage this positive feedback in promotional campaigns to attract new customers. Consider creating referral programs that reward existing customers for bringing in new clients. Maintain the high standards of service that led to this positive remark.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(111, 0, 'Tamri bank ma koi na pan balamen na kari sakay', 'Generic', 'Neutral', 'High', 'Frustration', 'The customer is frustrated with the inability to perform transactions at the bank.', 'Investigate the issues causing transaction difficulties and address them promptly. Communicate any changes or improvements to customers to rebuild trust. Consider providing additional training to staff to ensure they can assist customers effectively.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
