	(113, 10, 'Data sync across products should be synced.', 'Digital Process Issue', 'Neutral', 'Medium', 'Frustration', 'The customer is disappointed with the lack of data synchronization across products.', 'Prioritize the development of a seamless data synchronization feature across all products. Communicate with customers about upcoming improvements and timelines. Gather feedback from users to ensure the new system meets their needs.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(114, 9, 'everything is good, just i haven\'t received the welcome kit even after almost 8 days. hope you can improve this also\n', 'Satisfied Customer', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Frustration', 'The customer has not received their welcome kit after a significant delay.', 'Investigate the cause of the delay in sending welcome kits and rectify the issue. Ensure that customers are informed about the status of their welcome kits. Consider sending a follow-up message to apologize for the delay and reassure customers of their importance.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(115, 10, 'As of now, none.. will let you know after thw experience! ', 'Generic', 'Neutral', 'Low', 'Neutral', 'The customer has not yet formed an opinion about the bank\'s services.', 'Engage with the customer to gather feedback after their initial experiences. Provide them with information about services and benefits to encourage a positive impression. Follow up regularly to ensure their needs are being met.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
