	(117, 10, 'Nothing But One Thing I need To say \nDon\'t force to make intional Deposit for 10k savings account \nBecause lot off resoon will happen in customer side so give some time to deposit intional payment thanks you', 'App / Online Banking related', 'Negative', 'Medium', 'Frustration', 'The customer is frustrated with the requirement for an initial deposit for a savings account.', 'Reevaluate the policy regarding initial deposits and consider offering flexible options for customers. Communicate clearly about the reasons for the policy and provide alternatives if possible. Gather customer feedback to understand their concerns and adjust policies accordingly.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(118, 10, 'It was a wonderful experience.', 'Competence Staff', 'Positive', 'High', 'Satisfied', 'The customer had a wonderful experience with the bank.', 'Continue to maintain high service standards to ensure customer satisfaction. Consider gathering feedback to identify areas for further improvement. Highlight positive experiences in marketing materials to attract new customers.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(119, 10, 'The Executives in the bank are clear in opening the account but not explaining the details clearly and they are even informing false info to open an account, that should be avoided for sure ', ' Mis-selling', 'Negative', 'High', 'Frustration', 'Customers are frustrated with the lack of clear information and false details provided by bank executives.', 'Implement a training program for executives to improve communication skills and ensure accurate information is provided. Regularly review and update training materials to reflect current policies. Establish a feedback loop where customers can report misinformation.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
