	(168, 10, 'We impressed to know your easy going inland and abroad banking services ', 'Happy with Service', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'Customers appreciate the ease of banking services both domestically and internationally.', 'Promote the features of your banking services more actively to attract new customers. Highlighting the ease of use in marketing materials can help in building trust and attracting a wider audience.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(169, 10, 'Very nice service customer support processing time in every field ', 'Happy with Service', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'Customers are pleased with the quick processing times of customer support.', 'Maintain the current efficiency in processing times and consider implementing a tracking system for customer inquiries. This can enhance transparency and further improve customer satisfaction.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
