	(171, 10, 'I would like to suggest that the customer be allowed to change the user name atleast once in lifetime for the existing customers for additional safety in course of compromisation the net banking personal credentials in lines with the ICICI Bank as it happened in my case. This may require in your policy changes but would go a long way as a additional security measure of the customer who have become victims to the fraudsters due to negligence or otherwise.', 'Fraud / Misconduct / Escalation', 'Negative', 'High', 'Frustration', 'A customer experienced issues with a fund transfer that did not go smoothly, leading to dissatisfaction.', 'Investigate the cause of the transfer issue and ensure that the process is streamlined to prevent future occurrences. Communicate any changes made to customers to rebuild trust and confidence in the banking process.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(172, 10, 'Everything, The process and the staff were swift, fair and clear. ', 'Competence Staff', 'Positive', 'High', 'Satisfied', 'The customer praised the excellent service provided by a specific staff member.', 'Recognize and reward employees who provide exceptional service to encourage a culture of excellence. Sharing positive feedback internally can motivate other staff members to strive for similar levels of service.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(173, 10, 'Itâ€™s over all a very good experience. ', 'Competence Staff', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'Customers express gratitude for fast and efficient service.', 'Continue to prioritize speed and efficiency in service delivery. Regularly review processes to identify areas for improvement and ensure that customer expectations are consistently met.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(174, 10, 'Great Experience With Idfc first bank .great Experience With Idfc first bank ', 'Competence Staff', 'Positive', 'High', 'Satisfied', 'Customers express a positive sentiment towards their experience with IDFC First Bank, highlighting good service and a fast account opening process.', 'Continue to maintain high service standards and ensure that customers feel valued. Consider implementing a feedback loop to gather insights on customer experiences regularly. This will help in identifying areas for improvement and reinforcing positive aspects.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(175, 9, 'Overall Im happy to say that the service is really good.\n', 'Happy with Service', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'Customers are generally happy with the service provided by the bank.', 'To enhance customer satisfaction, ensure that all staff are trained to maintain consistent service quality. Regularly review customer feedback to identify trends and areas for improvement. This proactive approach can help in sustaining customer loyalty.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(176, 10, 'Fast process to open account', 'Seamless Account opening', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Neutral', 'The account opening process is noted to be quick and efficient.', 'Promote the efficiency of the account opening process in marketing materials to attract new customers. Additionally, consider gathering testimonials from satisfied customers to further enhance credibility. This can help in building trust with potential clients.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(177, 9, 'Selected Number se Account ko open karwana......', 'Customer Support & Follow-up', 'Positive', 'High', 'Frustration', 'A customer had a negative experience due to a discrepancy between what was promised and what was delivered.', 'Address the issue by reviewing the training provided to agents to ensure they deliver on promises made to customers. Implement a follow-up system to check on customers who have initiated account closures to understand their concerns better. This can help in retaining customers and improving service quality.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(178, 0, 'Worst experience ever\nAgent suggested one thing and delivered another. Already initiated to close the accy but still not closed ', 'Service Dissatisfaction', 'Negative', 'Medium', 'Neutral', 'A customer appreciates the kind behavior of the staff.', 'Recognize and reward staff members who demonstrate exceptional customer service. This can motivate employees to continue providing excellent service. Additionally, consider sharing positive feedback with the team to reinforce the importance of customer interactions.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(179, 10, 'Thank u for your kind behaviour \n', 'Competence Staff', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Disappointment', 'A customer has not received any updates about their account since it was opened.', 'Implement a system for regular communication with customers regarding their account status and updates. This could include automated messages or newsletters. Ensuring customers are informed can enhance their overall experience and reduce feelings of neglect.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(180, 10, 'Yes, since the account opened I haven\'t received any WhatsApp updates about balance and account updation. This surgery message was the very first WhatsApp message I got from your bank', 'App / Online Banking related', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'The services provided by a specific branch were well-received.', 'Highlight the positive feedback from the Matunga East Branch in internal communications to encourage other branches to emulate their success. Consider conducting branch-specific training sessions to share best practices and improve overall service quality across all locations.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(181, 10, 'All services was good from Matunga East Branch ', 'Happy with Service', 'Positive', 'Low', 'Neutral', 'A customer expressed a need for more information regarding account features and benefits.', 'Develop comprehensive documentation outlining account features and benefits, and make it easily accessible to customers. Consider creating a digital version that can be shared via email or WhatsApp. This will help customers make informed decisions and enhance their understanding of the services offered.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(182, 4, 'We had a time constraint to open a joint account and recieved our card and check book within a week. Friendly agent promised - back end chain was not upto deliver! With the result a very poor start of our relationship. ', 'Mis-selling', 'Negative', 'High', 'Frustration', 'The customer experienced significant delays and poor service while trying to open a joint account, leading to a negative start to their relationship with the bank.', 'To improve customer satisfaction, the bank should streamline the account opening process and ensure timely communication regarding any delays. Training staff to manage customer expectations effectively can also help mitigate frustration. Additionally, implementing a follow-up system to check on new account holders could enhance the overall experience.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(183, 9, 'Slabs on minimum monthly Average against the benefits against the same to be clearly explained to the customer before opening the account.', 'Account Opening Experience', 'Neutral', 'Medium', 'Neutral', 'The customer expressed a need for clearer communication regarding minimum monthly average requirements before account opening.', 'The bank should create clear and concise informational materials that explain account requirements and benefits. Providing this information upfront can help customers make informed decisions. Additionally, training staff to communicate these details effectively during the account opening process is essential.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(184, 10, 'It was easy and very cooperative process to open a Account.', 'Seamless Account opening', 'Positive', 'Low', 'Satisfied', 'The customer found the account opening process to be easy and cooperative.', 'To maintain this positive sentiment, the bank should continue to train staff on customer service best practices. Gathering feedback from satisfied customers can also help identify what works well and replicate those practices across the organization.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(185, 0, '???? ??? ?????? ???? ? ???? ??? ??? ????? ???? ?? ??? ????? ??? ?????? ??? ??? ??????? ????? ??? ???? ?? ???? ?????? ?? ???? ?????? ???? ??? ?? ?? ????? ???? ??? ??????? ??????? ???? ??? ???', 'Generic', 'Neutral', 'Low', 'Neutral', 'The remark is in an unreadable format and does not provide clear insights.', 'The bank should consider implementing a system to translate or clarify customer feedback that is not in a standard format. This could involve hiring multilingual staff or using translation services to ensure all customer voices are heard.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(186, 0, 'I give zero rating because it is takes more than one month to open my account. Also,while registering my mobile number in data entry, your team has mentioned wrong number. So that\'s why I\'m not able to register for mobile and netbanking. I requested to the team to update my number almost one week time there is no update yet. Additionally, still not receive the welcoming kit. it\'s shows that how poor service IDFC is providing to their customers. Extremely disappointed with the bank and never recommend to any one to open the bank account in IDFC?', 'Service Dissatisfaction', 'Negative', 'High', 'Disappointment', 'The customer expressed extreme disappointment due to delays in account opening and issues with mobile number registration.', 'Immediate action is required to address the customer\'s concerns, including updating their mobile number and expediting the account opening process. The bank should also review its internal processes to identify bottlenecks and improve service delivery. Regular training for staff on handling customer issues promptly can enhance overall satisfaction.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(187, 10, 'Bahut hi acchi service provide Karta Hai \n IDFC first bank thank you so much', 'Seamless Account opening', 'Positive', 'Low', 'Satisfied', 'The customer expressed gratitude for the excellent service provided by the bank.', 'To build on this positive feedback, the bank should recognize and reward staff who deliver exceptional service. Sharing success stories internally can motivate employees and reinforce a customer-centric culture.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(188, 10, 'The service is excellent ??', 'Happy with Service', 'Positive', 'Low', 'Satisfied', 'The customer rated the service as excellent.', 'The bank should continue to gather feedback from satisfied customers to understand what aspects of the service are appreciated. This information can be used to maintain high service standards and replicate successful practices across all branches.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(189, 0, 'The account was for Mrs. Sharayu Hibare. The primary reason for opening the account was for trading and it was clarified during account opening that it was to be a minimum balance account.\n\nWe were told that there is no option to open such an account and were insisted upon to have an account with 25,000 as a minimum balance. We categorically declined and when this was done, both the agent and the branch manager were unhelpful, and we were told to come to the bank to submit a letter to the same effect.\n\nHow is it possible that for a senior citizen, there is no option to open an account with minimum balance???\n\nThis is a very unhelpful way of assisting any customer, needing an account at your bank. We have two other IDFC bank accounts, but are very disappointed with the service that Mr. Kiran and this particular branch has provided.', 'Service Delays / Account Issues', 'Negative', 'High', 'Frustration', 'The customer faced unhelpfulness from staff regarding account options for senior citizens, leading to disappointment.', 'The bank must review its policies to ensure that they accommodate the needs of all customers, including senior citizens. Training staff to be more empathetic and solution-oriented can improve customer interactions. Additionally, creating specific account options for seniors could enhance service offerings.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(190, 10, 'I want to change my mobile no. Now . Please help me ', 'Customer Support & Follow-up', 'Neutral', 'Medium', 'Neutral', 'The customer is seeking assistance to change their mobile number.', 'The bank should streamline the process for customers wishing to update their personal information. Providing clear instructions and a dedicated support line for such requests can enhance customer experience. Additionally, ensuring timely follow-up on these requests is crucial.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(191, 0, 'HDFC ka hamare pass credit Card hai aur usmein mera account bhi tha use account mein band karva kar aapke Bank mein account khulvaya aur hamara credit card ka bil aapke bank se hi bil jama Kiya jaega Kya Mera credit card ka bil use Bank Se jama ho sakta hai aur jitna bhi bil hai loan Ho ya gold loan Ho bijali bil Ho sab Ham aapke net banking se bhugtan karna chahte hain kya yah sambhav hai ya yah kaise hoga', ' Loan Related issues', 'Negative', 'Medium', 'Neutral', 'The customer is inquiring about the possibility of making payments through net banking for various bills.', 'The bank should provide clear information regarding the capabilities of its net banking services. Creating a comprehensive FAQ section on the website can help customers understand what services are available. Additionally, offering personalized assistance for complex inquiries can improve customer satisfaction.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(192, 10, 'Arranged an followup calls , which let me know my account benefits...', 'Customer Support & Follow-up', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'The customer appreciates the follow-up calls and the information provided about account benefits.', 'Continue to maintain regular follow-up calls to keep customers informed about their account benefits. This practice can enhance customer satisfaction and loyalty. Consider implementing a feedback mechanism to gather insights on the effectiveness of these calls.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(193, 4, 'There is no more suggestions over all good experience. ', 'Competence Staff', 'Positive', 'Low', 'Neutral', 'The customer expresses a lack of suggestions, indicating a satisfactory experience.', 'Encourage customers to share their thoughts and suggestions to further improve services. Consider conducting surveys to gather more detailed feedback on their experiences and areas for enhancement.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(194, 10, 'More branches required at district level and more representation also required at national level.\n\nIDFC Bank will be number one soon And your competitor bankers are really worried about it, so please keep up the good work and continue your Excellent  Services for the good customers who are more loyal towards you.\n\nI really appreciate, and please extend my thanks to the Branch Manager and your staff as they were very helpful and kind at the Kalyan Nagar branch Bangalore.\n\nMy good wishes Are with the chairman, managing directors and all the IDFC team members.\n', 'Happy with Service', 'Positive', 'High', 'Satisfied', 'The customer expresses a strong positive sentiment towards the bank\'s services and staff.', 'Leverage this positive feedback by recognizing and rewarding the staff mentioned for their excellent service. Additionally, consider expanding branch locations as suggested to enhance accessibility and representation.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(195, 10, 'Nothing as such all the best team \n\n', 'satisfied Customer', 'Positive', 'Low', 'Neutral', 'The customer wishes the team well, indicating a neutral sentiment.', 'Maintain the positive relationship with customers by sending periodic updates and appreciation messages. This can help keep the brand top-of-mind and encourage future engagement.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(196, 3, 'I donâ€™t want to open the account but still I insisted as a taken loan, but my wish was not opening account with IDFC because of pathetic service ', 'Account Opening Experience', 'Negative', 'High', 'Frustration', 'The customer is frustrated with the service and does not want to open an account due to past experiences.', 'Address the customer\'s concerns directly by offering a resolution or compensation for the poor service experienced. Implement training for staff to improve service quality and ensure that similar issues do not arise in the future.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(197, 0, 'Just refund back my money that\'s it', 'Fraud / Misconduct / Escalation', 'Negative', 'High', 'Anger', 'The customer is angry and demands a refund.', 'Prioritize resolving this issue by processing the refund promptly. Follow up with the customer to apologize for the inconvenience and ensure that their concerns are addressed to prevent future occurrences.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(198, 9, 'Reason for opening this account with you is better interest rate offered(7.25%) First wealth account. A note confirming the same should also be shared with customer about the current rate of interest on saving account.', 'Seamless Account opening', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Neutral', 'The customer is interested in the better interest rate and requests confirmation.', 'Ensure that customers receive timely updates and confirmations regarding interest rates and account details. This transparency can build trust and encourage more customers to engage with the bank\'s offerings.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(199, 10, 'Very happy to be associated with such a fast growing institution promoting the best values of banking.. especially with the care and positive attitude of my relationship manager. IDFC FIRST to grow hassle free ', 'Satisfied Customer', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'The customer is happy with the institution\'s growth and the positive attitude of their relationship manager.', 'Continue to foster a positive relationship between customers and relationship managers. Regular training and support for staff can enhance customer interactions and contribute to overall satisfaction.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
