	(212, 10, 'I have FD base credit card limit 10000. But not available any credit limit for me.. I have savings account and fb base credit card. I have many other banks credit card but I haven\'t Idfc bank credit card.  \n\nPlease provide IDFC credit card limit.\nMobile no. [PHONE]\nPlease call me back. ', 'Credit Card related', 'Negative', 'High', 'Frustration', 'The customer is frustrated due to the unavailability of a credit limit despite having multiple accounts and credit cards.', 'Reach out to the customer to clarify the criteria for credit limit approvals. Consider reviewing their account history and creditworthiness to provide a tailored solution. Additionally, ensure that the customer is informed about the steps they can take to improve their chances of receiving a credit limit.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(213, 10, 'I am all good process was fast and very good experience ', 'Competence Staff', 'Positive', 'Low', 'Satisfied', 'The customer had a fast and positive experience with the process.', 'Continue to maintain efficient processes to ensure customer satisfaction. Gather feedback on what specifically made the process fast and good to replicate in future interactions. Consider sharing this positive feedback with the team to encourage continued excellence.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
