	(265, 10, 'MR.Naseer Hussain was very helpful in guiding and account activation and mobile bankaing', 'Seamless Account opening', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'Customer found Mr. Naseer Hussain helpful in guiding account activation and mobile banking.', 'Highlight Mr. Naseer Hussain\'s effective assistance in internal communications to motivate other staff. Consider creating a mentorship program where experienced staff can guide new employees. Regularly review customer feedback to identify areas for improvement in account activation processes.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(266, 9, 'Subject: Feedback on Account Funding Process at the Time of Opening\n\nDear IDFC FIRST Bank Team,\n\nAt the time of opening my account, I was informed that a cheque was required to fund the account. While I understand this may be a part of your current process, I wanted to share my personal experience with other banks such as HDFC and Axis, where the process was more flexible and convenient. In those cases, my account was activated first, and I was then given the option to fund it via NEFT/RTGS, which I found to be much quicker and more efficient.\n\nGiven that cheque usage is gradually declining and many customers now opt not to request a cheque book unless absolutely necessary, I would like to suggest that IDFC FIRST Bank consider providing multiple options to fund a newly opened accountâ€”such as UPI, NEFT/RTGS, or IMPS.\n\nOffering digital alternatives would make the onboarding experience more seamless and in line with modern banking preferences.\n\nI hope you will consider this suggestion to enhance customer convenience.\n\nThank you for your attention.\n\nBest regards,\nChitra Vijay Game ', 'Debit Card / Cheque Book / Welcome Kit related', 'Positive', 'High', 'Frustration', 'Customer is disappointed with the account funding process, preferring more flexible options.', 'Evaluate the current account funding process and explore the integration of digital payment options like UPI, NEFT, and RTGS. Conduct a market analysis to understand competitor offerings and customer preferences. Implement changes to streamline the onboarding experience and communicate these improvements to customers.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(267, 10, 'I have taken a Credit Card from IDFC FIRST BABK,but the saleswomen misguided me telling me that the Credit Card will have Domestic Airport Lounge Access.\n\nWhere as upon getting the card, I saw it has only railways lounge access not domestic air lounge access.', 'Credit Card related', 'Negative', 'High', 'Frustration', 'Customer feels misled about the credit card benefits regarding lounge access.', 'Review the sales training program to ensure accurate information is provided to customers. Implement a verification process for claims made by sales staff. Communicate clearly with customers about the features of their products to prevent misunderstandings.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(268, 10, 'Good service Given by Somya', 'Happy with Service', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Frustration', 'Customer feels neglected after the account opening process, indicating a lack of ongoing support.', 'Establish a follow-up protocol for new account holders to ensure they feel supported post-opening. Train staff to maintain engagement with customers and respond promptly to inquiries. Consider implementing a customer relationship management system to track interactions and follow-ups.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(269, 7, 'An experience has been given by the branch staff that their interest was only up to the opening of account. Once the account opening process was done, the staff who visited did not show any concern. Has the relationship "started " or " ended" by the branch staff. Even, no proper response to emails. ', 'Service Delays / Account Issues', 'Negative', 'Low', 'Satisfied', 'Customer appreciates the cooperative and calm behavior of the staff.', 'Encourage staff to maintain their positive demeanor and provide regular feedback on their performance. Consider team-building activities to strengthen cooperation among staff. Recognize and celebrate instances of exceptional customer service to motivate the team.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
