	(275, 9, 'It was easy, to open account and it easily to use it and everything instant net banking and stuff', 'Seamless Account opening', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Frustration', 'The customer feels pressured by agents regarding minimum balance maintenance, indicating dissatisfaction with the communication approach.', 'Review the communication strategy used by agents to ensure it is customer-friendly. Consider providing options for customers who may not want to maintain a minimum balance, allowing for more flexibility.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(276, 0, 'I am recieving calls from agents telling to maintain My minimum balance.I am ready to pay the charges for not maintaing it but they are forcing me to maintain it\n', 'Agent Behaviour', 'Negative', 'High', 'Frustration', 'The remark indicates dissatisfaction with staff behavior, suggesting a lack of professionalism in customer interactions.', 'Implement training programs focused on customer service and communication skills for staff. Establish a feedback mechanism to monitor staff interactions and address any issues promptly.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(277, 0, 'Staff should mature enough to talk with customers properly. They always sees there benefits.\n', 'Agent Behaviour', 'Negative', 'High', 'Satisfied', 'The customer expresses high satisfaction with the service provided by IDFC FIRST BANK, indicating a positive experience.', 'Leverage this positive feedback in marketing efforts to attract new customers. Consider gathering more testimonials to showcase the bank\'s strengths and commitment to customer service.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(278, 10, 'Amazing Service by IDFC FIRST BANK', 'Happy with Service', 'Positive', 'High', 'Satisfied', 'The customer describes their account opening experience as the easiest ever, indicating a high level of satisfaction.', 'Continue to streamline account opening processes to maintain this level of satisfaction. Regularly review and update procedures to ensure they remain efficient and customer-friendly.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(279, 9, 'No  I think every thing is good .  Agent describe about account Opening document needed very well.\nAgent tell everything how to use net banking on your phone. Overall i give 5 out of 5 rating for idfc first bank service.', 'Happy with Service', 'Positive', 'High', 'Satisfied', 'The customer expressed complete satisfaction with the service provided by the agent, rating it 5 out of 5.', 'Continue to maintain high service standards and ensure agents are well-trained in explaining account opening processes. Regularly gather feedback to identify areas for improvement and reinforce positive experiences.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(280, 10, 'Nothing the experience was 10/10 specially gupta ji helped and explained lot about account ', 'Seamless Account opening', 'Positive', 'High', 'Satisfied', 'The customer rated their experience as 10/10, highlighting the helpfulness of the agent.', 'Recognize and reward agents who provide exceptional service to encourage continued excellence. Consider implementing a referral program to leverage satisfied customers for new client acquisition.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(281, 10, 'Please update new customer to welcome kit and if possible to early provide I have open 8 may acc today 15 may still now I m not receive any account kit like debit card cheque book ', 'Debit Card / Cheque Book / Welcome Kit related', 'Negative', 'Medium', 'Frustration', 'The customer is frustrated due to the delay in receiving their welcome kit after opening an account.', 'Improve the logistics and communication regarding the welcome kit delivery process. Provide customers with tracking information and estimated delivery times to manage expectations.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(282, 10, ' Very good service and fast prossing', 'Happy with Service', 'Positive', 'High', 'Satisfied', 'The customer praised the service for being very good and fast.', 'Continue to prioritize efficiency in service delivery. Regularly review processes to identify opportunities for further streamlining and enhancing customer satisfaction.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(283, 10, 'The Welcome kit was hightech and it was a little difficult for me ,a Senior Citizen, to shut off the Screen. Possibly  Printed Literature could be used for Accounts Designated as " Senior Citizen ".\n\nA Debit Card is issued to the Joint Account Holder as well. The Joint Account Holder is added as a matter of convenience AND is Authorised to operate the Account. But the control has to be with the First Account Holder  who is the Owner of the Account.', 'Debit Card / Cheque Book / Welcome Kit related', 'Negative', 'Medium', 'Disappointment', 'The customer found the welcome kit high-tech and difficult to use, especially as a senior citizen.', 'Consider creating simplified guides or printed literature specifically for senior citizens to enhance their experience. Additionally, gather feedback from senior customers to tailor services to their needs.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(284, 10, 'Very good service and satisfactory 100%', 'Happy with Service', 'Positive', 'High', 'Satisfied', 'The customer expressed complete satisfaction with their banking experience.', 'Leverage this positive feedback to promote your services. Encourage satisfied customers to share their experiences on social media or review platforms to attract new clients.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(285, 10, 'Nothing to improve as such. I had the best banking experience so far. Delighted with everything. ', 'Competence Staff', 'Positive', 'Low', 'Neutral', 'The customer did not provide any specific feedback or suggestions for improvement.', 'Engage with this customer to understand their experience better. A follow-up survey could help gather insights and encourage them to share any thoughts they may have.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(286, 9, 'Nhi esi koi chij nhi \n', 'Generic', 'Neutral', 'Medium', 'Frustration', 'The customer is frustrated with the credit card adding process, specifically the SIM verification step.', 'Review the credit card application process to identify pain points. Simplifying the SIM verification step could enhance the customer experience and reduce frustration.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(287, 9, 'Rupy credit card adding process is not good and every time asking sim versification please make this step easier.', 'Satisfied Customer', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Frustration', 'The customer expressed concern about the high maintenance balance required.', 'Consider reviewing the maintenance balance requirements and explore options for lower thresholds. Communicate any changes clearly to customers to improve their satisfaction.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(288, 10, 'Happy for new account open ', 'Seamless Account opening', 'Positive', 'Low', 'Satisfied', 'The customer expresses happiness about opening a new account.', 'Continue to promote the ease of account opening to attract more customers. Highlight the benefits of new accounts in marketing materials to maintain this positive sentiment.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(289, 10, 'Account open karaya jisase bahut achha vyavahar aur sari bate bahut saral aur spasht shabdo me batayi', 'Seamless Account opening', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'The customer appreciates the clear communication and good behavior during the account opening process.', 'Ensure that all staff are trained to maintain high standards of communication and customer service. Regular feedback sessions can help reinforce these behaviors.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(290, 10, 'No , the relationship manager mayank was very humble and knowledgeable. ', 'Competence Staff', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'The customer found the relationship manager to be humble and knowledgeable.', 'Recognize and reward relationship managers who receive positive feedback. This can motivate them to continue providing excellent service and encourage others to follow suit.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(291, 10, 'Very good behaviour of exicutive parth prajapati and he explained everything about  fundamentals of idfc bank and end to end account opening process and about acount benefits..', 'Seamless Account opening', 'Positive', 'High', 'Satisfied', 'The customer praises the executive for explaining the account opening process thoroughly.', 'Implement a standardized training program for all executives to ensure consistent and thorough explanations of processes. This can enhance customer trust and satisfaction.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(292, 10, 'Very Knowledgeable, polite & quick responce ', 'Satisfied Customer', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'The customer appreciates the knowledgeable and polite service with quick responses.', 'Maintain a focus on training staff in product knowledge and customer service skills. Quick response times should be monitored and improved where necessary.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(293, 2, 'I don\'t know why every bank is so keen to offer savings accounts, what special you guys are giving or other any bank bank. Its just a game of using someone else\'s money to provide loan to someone. You guys are also doing the same. On the name of maintenance need to keep 10k all the time so you guys can use for yourself.', 'Charges, Fees, Balance Requirements', 'Negative', 'High', 'Frustration', 'The customer expresses frustration about the banking industry\'s practices regarding savings accounts.', 'Address customer concerns by being transparent about how savings accounts work and the benefits they provide. Consider offering unique features or incentives to differentiate from competitors.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(294, 0, 'Please be transparent in your activities and keep customer informed. ', 'Mis-selling', 'Negative', 'High', 'Frustration', 'The customer requests more transparency and communication from the bank.', 'Develop a communication strategy that keeps customers informed about account activities and bank policies. Regular updates can help build trust and reduce frustration.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(295, 10, 'I am highly satisfied with the Bank\n', 'Satisfied Customer', 'Positive', 'Low', 'Satisfied', 'The customer expresses high satisfaction with the bank.', 'Leverage this positive feedback in marketing campaigns to attract new customers. Consider conducting surveys to gather more insights on what contributes to customer satisfaction.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(296, 10, 'Good response from your side thanks', 'Satisfied Customer', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'The customer appreciates the good response from the bank.', 'Continue to prioritize timely responses to customer inquiries. Implementing a feedback loop can help identify areas for improvement in response times.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(297, 7, 'New users to A/c could have been guided guided up time to time to keep in touch by the banks personnels.', 'Service Dissatisfaction', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Disappointment', 'The customer suggests that new users should receive ongoing guidance from bank personnel.', 'Establish a mentorship program for new account holders to ensure they receive continuous support. Regular check-ins can help improve customer engagement and satisfaction.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(298, 10, 'Good service by staff and good for senior citizen people', 'Happy with Service', 'Positive', 'Low', 'Satisfied', 'Customers appreciate the good service provided by staff, especially for senior citizens.', 'Continue to prioritize excellent customer service, particularly for senior citizens. Consider implementing training programs to enhance staff interactions with this demographic. Regularly gather feedback to ensure their needs are being met.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(299, 10, 'It was very good experience of opening a savings accounts.', 'Seamless Account opening', 'Positive', 'Low', 'Satisfied', 'Customers report a very good experience when opening savings accounts.', 'Maintain the current process for opening savings accounts to ensure customer satisfaction. Consider promoting this positive experience through testimonials or case studies. Encourage staff to share best practices that contribute to this positive feedback.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(300, 9, 'Yes somehow you managed to send my starter package to a hotel I stayed   2 mos ago .  Donâ€™t knhow you even got that address ', 'Generic', 'Neutral', 'Medium', 'Frustration', 'There is confusion regarding the delivery of the starter package to an outdated address.', 'Implement a verification step for customer addresses during the onboarding process. Ensure that customers can easily update their information. Follow up with the customer to resolve the issue and reassure them of improved processes.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(301, 9, 'Need pre approved credit card and loans need to be added, based on account savings ', 'Credit Card related', 'Neutral', 'Medium', 'Frustration', 'Customers are requesting the addition of pre-approved credit cards and loans based on their savings accounts.', 'Evaluate the feasibility of offering pre-approved credit options to customers with savings accounts. Conduct market research to understand customer demand and preferences. Communicate any new offerings clearly to existing customers.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(302, 10, 'Excellent work thank you soo much for your great experience.', 'Competence Staff', 'Positive', 'Low', 'Satisfied', 'Customers express gratitude for the excellent service they received.', 'Recognize and reward staff for their contributions to customer satisfaction. Share positive feedback with the team to motivate them. Consider creating a customer appreciation program to further enhance the customer experience.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(303, 0, 'Pl. Take care & give preference to senior citizen,  whether dealing with saving a/c or other txn.', 'Customer Support & Follow-up', 'Negative', 'Medium', 'Frustration', 'There is a request for better attention to senior citizens in transactions.', 'Develop specific policies or programs that cater to the needs of senior citizens. Train staff to recognize and address the unique challenges faced by this demographic. Regularly review and adjust services based on feedback from senior customers.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(304, 10, 'Nahi aap ka kam uttam paya', 'Generic', 'Neutral', 'Low', 'Neutral', 'A customer expresses a neutral sentiment about the service received.', 'Engage with the customer to understand their experience better and identify areas for improvement. Encourage them to provide specific feedback on what could enhance their experience. Use this information to refine service offerings.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(305, 10, 'Every thing fine. Excellent service from operating staff. However, welcome kit has not yet received. Of course, that is not any issue. Welcome kit may be on the way. Kudos to team Girinagar  and Uttarahally branch team . ( Bangalore 560085)', 'Happy with Service', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Frustration', 'A customer has not yet received their welcome kit but remains optimistic.', 'Ensure timely delivery of welcome kits to new customers. Implement a tracking system to monitor the status of these kits. Communicate proactively with customers about any delays and provide updates on their delivery.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(306, 10, 'Every thing is very good and appropriate.', 'Satisfied Customer', 'Positive', 'Low', 'Satisfied', 'Customers feel that everything is fine and service is excellent.', 'Continue to maintain high service standards to keep customer satisfaction levels high. Regularly solicit feedback to identify any potential areas for improvement. Celebrate successes with the team to reinforce positive behaviors.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(307, 10, 'Thanks for overall nice experience!!!', 'Competence Staff', 'Positive', 'Low', 'Satisfied', 'Customers express overall satisfaction with their experience.', 'Leverage positive customer experiences in marketing efforts. Encourage satisfied customers to share their experiences through reviews or referrals. Continue to monitor customer satisfaction to ensure ongoing positive experiences.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(308, 10, 'All the service and app is absolutely great', 'App / Online Banking related', 'Positive', 'High', 'Frustration', 'The customer experienced a significant error during the account opening process, leading to a loss of trust in the bank\'s services.', 'The bank should implement a more rigorous training program for staff to ensure they are fully competent in their roles. Additionally, a review process for account openings should be established to catch errors before they affect customers. Providing a clear escalation path for customers to voice concerns can also help mitigate frustration.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(309, 0, 'India is lacking skilled labor. This is true. At IDFC bank as well. The person at Barakhamba Branch with surname JHA who opened my account on his mobile did a huge mistake. He selected Barabanki instead of Barakhamba and opened the account. And on pointing his mistake, i choosed to close the account right away. \n\nIf such people can\'t do their job properly, why they are doing it then. It is the loss of bank only. I should have kept the account if it would have been Barakhamba branch. And now, my money is not with IDFC bank and even my referrals are not for IDFC bank now. \n\nI felt threatened while interactig with JHA that day because i pointed out his huge mistake. And he wanted me to leave the bank asap as i was sitting there and waiting to talk to some senior about it. \n\nBank should hire people via strict vetting. As business may go coz of such experience. ', 'Mis-selling', 'Negative', 'Medium', 'Disappointment', 'The customer is confused about how to change their account type and feels uncertain about the process.', 'The bank should create clear, accessible resources for customers to understand how to change their account types. This could include a dedicated FAQ section on the website or a customer service hotline specifically for account-related inquiries. Additionally, proactive communication from the bank regarding account options could enhance customer satisfaction.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(310, 9, 'Iam a serving armed person, i hear about idfc salary saving account and its benifits from my colleague,, but now i get atm card of normal saving account, how can i change muly account from saving account to defence salary account', 'Customer Support & Follow-up', 'Neutral', 'Low', 'Neutral', 'The customer is suggesting additional features for their debit card, indicating a desire for more comprehensive services.', 'The bank should consider expanding the features of their debit cards to include benefits like insurance coverage and airport lounge access. Conducting customer surveys to gather feedback on desired features can help tailor offerings to meet customer needs and enhance satisfaction.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(311, 10, 'Insurance coverage with a debit card airport lounge facility etc', 'Debit Card / Cheque Book / Welcome Kit related', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Fear', 'The customer felt uncomfortable about the security of their documents during the account opening process.', 'The bank should ensure that all agents are trained to communicate the security measures in place for document handling clearly. Providing customers with written assurances about data security and using secure devices for document collection can help alleviate concerns. Regular training sessions on customer communication can also improve overall customer experience.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(312, 9, 'Agent needs to clearly explain that all documents that he is collecting is secure. While this was explained to me, the fact that it was made on his personal device, however secure made me bit uncomfortable. ', ' Mis-selling', 'Negative', 'Low', 'Satisfied', 'The customer is pleased with the current process and finds it effective.', 'The bank should continue to monitor and maintain the current processes that customers find satisfactory. Gathering regular feedback from customers can help identify areas for improvement while ensuring that successful practices are preserved. Celebrating and sharing positive customer experiences can also enhance the bank\'s reputation.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(313, 10, 'The current process is best.', 'Satisfied Customer', 'Positive', 'High', 'Satisfied', 'The customer had a seamless experience with account opening and praised the service provided.', 'The bank should recognize and reward employees like Subrata who provide exceptional service to encourage a culture of excellence. Sharing positive feedback internally can motivate staff and reinforce the importance of customer service. Additionally, the bank should continue to streamline processes that contribute to a positive customer experience.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(314, 10, 'Thanks for the seamless account opening and operation .. Keep it up', 'Seamless Account opening', 'Positive', 'Low', 'Satisfied', 'The customer expressed gratitude for the good service received at the branch.', 'The bank should continue to promote a customer-centric culture among its staff to maintain high service levels. Regular training and recognition programs can help sustain employee motivation and performance. Encouraging customers to share their positive experiences can also enhance the bank\'s image.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(315, 10, 'There is no improvement required. The training of the salesperson is great. My onboarding was done seamlessly.\n\nI had gone to the bank branch to enquire about the account opening, and they sent an executive for onboarding within 2 hours! Subrata was very understanding and helpful. The whole process was quite shocking for me , the account and NetBanking activation all online and within minutes compared to all the signing/documents required many years ago! He explained all the features really well and the best part was no unnecessary push for taking products like credit card etc.\n\nHighly recommend Subrata for his great attitude and behaviour. Please convey the feedback.\n\n', 'Seamless Account opening', 'Positive', 'Low', 'Satisfied', 'The customer had a good experience and expressed thanks.', 'The bank should continue to solicit feedback from customers to ensure that their positive experiences are consistent. Implementing a follow-up process after service interactions can help reinforce customer relationships. Additionally, sharing success stories can inspire staff to maintain high service standards.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(316, 10, 'All facilities is very fast and great, many features are provide your bank ', 'Satisfied Customer', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'The customer appreciates the speed and features of the bank\'s facilities.', 'Continue to enhance the features offered by the bank to maintain customer satisfaction. Regularly gather feedback to identify areas for improvement. Promote these features to attract new customers.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(317, 1, 'Pls. take immediate action against the fraud, misguiding, misleading, mischievous agent (Relationship Manager) Mr. Sudheer of Bangalore Basavanagudi Branch, so that he doesn\'t make the same mistake with the other customers as he did to me', 'Fraud / Misconduct / Escalation', 'Negative', 'High', 'Anger', 'The customer is frustrated with a specific relationship manager\'s actions that led to a negative experience.', 'Investigate the complaint against the relationship manager promptly. Implement training for staff on ethical practices and customer service. Ensure that customers feel heard and supported in their grievances.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(318, 10, 'Nice bank xperience and very fast server and service ', 'Happy with Service', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'The customer had a positive experience with the bank\'s service speed and efficiency.', 'Maintain the current service standards and continue to invest in technology to enhance service speed. Encourage customers to share their positive experiences through testimonials or referrals.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(319, 7, 'Customer welcome should be yours first priority ', 'Generic', 'Neutral', 'Medium', 'Disappointment', 'The customer feels that customer welcome should be prioritized more.', 'Review the customer onboarding process to ensure a warm and welcoming experience. Train staff to prioritize customer engagement and satisfaction from the first interaction. Consider implementing a feedback mechanism to continuously improve this aspect.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(320, 10, 'according to my personal experience everything is good,i do not have to face any kind of troubles, bank staff guides very well.\n\ni would like to thank the entire team of idfc bank sector 11 panchkula & specially Thanks to Durga sharma.', 'Seamless Account opening', 'Positive', 'Low', 'Satisfied', 'The customer expresses overall satisfaction with the bank\'s services and staff guidance.', 'Recognize and reward the staff for their excellent service to encourage continued performance. Share positive feedback with the team to boost morale. Consider conducting regular training sessions to maintain high service standards.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(321, 0, 'Donâ€™t give banking service ., worst of all', 'Service Dissatisfaction', 'Negative', 'High', 'Frustration', 'The customer is extremely dissatisfied with the banking service provided.', 'Conduct a thorough review of the customer\'s experience to identify specific issues. Implement immediate corrective actions to address the problems raised. Communicate with the customer to assure them that their concerns are being taken seriously.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(322, 10, 'I\'m so happy with your friendly relationship with costomer.\nIt\'s a great service and helpful people.\nNo problem on cash collection in bank .\nOnly 2 minutes and the money is in your hand with transection update .\n\n', 'Happy with Service', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'The customer is pleased with the friendly service and quick transaction times.', 'Continue to foster a friendly and helpful environment for customers. Highlight the efficiency of transactions in marketing materials. Encourage staff to maintain this level of service to enhance customer loyalty.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(323, 7, 'The Mobile app needs to be transparent and user friendly. Many features simply don\'t function at all ', 'App / Online Banking related', 'Negative', 'High', 'Frustration', 'The customer is frustrated with the mobile app\'s lack of transparency and functionality.', 'Prioritize a comprehensive review and update of the mobile app to address functionality issues. Engage users in the testing phase to gather feedback on usability. Communicate updates and improvements to customers to rebuild trust in the app.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(324, 9, 'You should not set the limit to 25000 per month, it is everytime keep in our head that we hv to maintain the balanece .....it should be 10k.', 'Charges, Fees, Balance Requirements', 'Negative', 'Medium', 'Frustration', 'The customer is unhappy with the imposed transaction limit and its impact on their banking experience.', 'Reassess the transaction limit policy to ensure it meets customer needs. Consider offering tiered limits based on customer profiles. Communicate any changes clearly to customers to alleviate concerns.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(325, 10, 'Very good app interface and albert from idfc branch campal/panaji helped me with kyc it was quick', 'Satisfied Customer', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'The customer appreciates the app interface and the assistance received during the KYC process.', 'Continue to enhance the app interface based on user feedback. Recognize and reward staff who provide exceptional service during KYC processes. Promote the ease of KYC completion as a selling point for new customers.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(326, 0, 'Atm not available  at your home branch ', 'Branch Access & Location related', 'Negative', 'High', 'Frustration', 'Customers are frustrated with the unavailability of ATMs at their home branch.', 'To address this issue, the bank should conduct a thorough assessment of ATM availability at all branches. Consider increasing the number of ATMs or providing alternative solutions, such as mobile banking options, to ensure customers have access to their funds. Communicating these changes to customers can help alleviate frustration.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(327, 10, 'I would like to express my sincere appreciation for the excellent service provided by Sumit/Sunita during my recent account opening process. They were professional, knowledgeable, and extremely helpful every step of the way. They patiently answered all my questions, clearly explained the options available, and ensured the process was smooth and efficient. Their friendly attitude and attention to detail made a great impression. I truly felt valued as a customer and am confident in my decision to bank here thanks to their outstanding support.', 'Happy with Service', 'Positive', 'High', 'Satisfied', 'Customers are highly appreciative of the excellent service provided during the account opening process.', 'Continue to recognize and reward employees like Sumit and Sunita for their outstanding service. Implement training programs to ensure all staff members can replicate this level of service. Additionally, consider gathering more customer feedback to identify other areas of strength and opportunities for improvement.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(328, 10, 'Account opening bilkul Acha h koi issue nhi aaya lakin netbanking very bad', 'Seamless Account opening', 'Neutral', 'Medium', 'Disappointment', 'While the account opening process was smooth, customers expressed disappointment with the net banking service.', 'Investigate the specific issues customers are facing with net banking and prioritize improvements in this area. Consider enhancing the user interface and providing clearer instructions for users. Regularly update customers on the progress of these improvements to maintain their trust.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(329, 10, 'Very nice service from Snehalata.she is really give me a good service. She will visit my home and give me service. Thank you', 'Happy with Service', 'Positive', 'High', 'Satisfied', 'Customers are pleased with the personalized service provided by staff members like Snehalata.', 'Encourage staff to continue providing personalized service and consider implementing a program that allows for home visits when necessary. This can enhance customer satisfaction and loyalty. Additionally, gather feedback on these services to ensure they meet customer needs effectively.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(330, 10, 'Account opening process is very smooth ', 'Seamless Account opening', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'The account opening process is reported to be very smooth by customers.', 'Maintain the current processes that contribute to a smooth account opening experience. Regularly review and update these processes to ensure they remain efficient. Consider sharing success stories with staff to motivate them and reinforce the importance of customer satisfaction.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(331, 0, 'Minimum spend was not told initially. Deceiving for finance company is unacceptable.', 'Customer Support & Follow-up', 'Negative', 'High', 'Frustration', 'Customers feel deceived due to a lack of initial communication regarding minimum spending requirements.', 'Improve transparency by clearly communicating all terms and conditions, including minimum spending requirements, at the outset. Consider creating a checklist or guide for customers during the account opening process. This will help manage expectations and reduce feelings of frustration.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(332, 9, 'Your staff is not helpful , I wanted a passbook at branch but they are not giving.', 'Agent Behaviour', 'Negative', 'High', 'Frustration', 'Customers are frustrated with unhelpful staff regarding passbook requests.', 'Provide additional training to staff on customer service and the importance of fulfilling customer requests. Implement a system for tracking customer requests to ensure they are addressed promptly. Regularly review customer feedback to identify areas for improvement in staff performance.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(333, 10, 'A very nice bank. Comfortable and with very helpful customer service ', 'Happy with Service', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'Customers find the bank comfortable and appreciate the helpful customer service.', 'Continue to foster a comfortable banking environment and ensure that customer service remains a priority. Regularly solicit feedback to identify what aspects of the service customers value most. Use this information to enhance the overall customer experience.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(334, 9, 'Nope nothing to Add ,maybe once I start using the Bank Aap and other services I can give valuable feedback ', 'Service Dissatisfaction', 'Neutral', 'Low', 'Neutral', 'Customers have no additional feedback until they start using the bank\'s app and services.', 'Encourage customers to explore the bank\'s app and services by providing tutorials or guides. Follow up with these customers after a set period to gather feedback on their experiences. This proactive approach can help identify potential issues early on.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(335, 10, 'Wonderful experience to you idfc tq??', 'Competence Staff', 'Positive', 'Low', 'Satisfied', 'Customers express a wonderful experience with the bank.', 'Celebrate and promote positive customer experiences through testimonials and case studies. This can enhance the bank\'s reputation and attract new customers. Continue to engage with satisfied customers to maintain their loyalty and encourage referrals.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(336, 10, 'Ha happy bhut achi bank\n', 'Satisfied Customer', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'The customer expresses happiness with the bank\'s services, indicating a positive experience.', 'Continue to maintain high service standards and consider gathering feedback to further enhance customer satisfaction. Highlighting positive experiences in marketing could attract new customers.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(337, 10, 'Your product credit card against fixed deposit. ', 'Credit Card related', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Neutral', 'The remark mentions a product offering without any emotional context, indicating a need for more information.', 'Provide clear and detailed information about the credit card against fixed deposit to help customers understand its benefits. Consider creating informative materials or FAQs to address common queries.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(338, 10, 'IVRL needs to be more friendly specially for issues like forex card help when abroad.\n', 'Customer Support & Follow-up', 'Positive', 'High', 'Frustration', 'The customer feels that IVRL is not friendly, especially regarding forex card assistance abroad.', 'Implement training programs for IVRL staff to improve customer interaction and support, particularly for international services. Consider creating a dedicated support line for forex card issues to enhance customer experience.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(339, 10, 'Bank ki AAP UPI or bank ka interest à¤¸à¤¹à¥€ à¤²à¤—à¤¾4', 'App / Online Banking related', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Neutral', 'The customer provides feedback on the bank\'s UPI and interest rates, indicating a need for clarity.', 'Ensure that information regarding UPI services and interest rates is easily accessible and clearly communicated to customers. Regular updates and educational content can help customers make informed decisions.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(340, 10, 'A detailed briefing on the availability of services and advantages of IDFC in maintaining a high MAB', 'Happy with Service', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Neutral', 'The customer requests detailed information about IDFC\'s services and advantages.', 'Create comprehensive guides or webinars that explain the services and benefits of maintaining a high MAB with IDFC. This can help customers understand the value proposition and encourage them to engage more with the bank.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(341, 6, 'why did the credit card application get rejected?', 'Credit Card related', 'Negative', 'High', 'Frustration', 'The customer is confused and frustrated about the rejection of their credit card application.', 'Establish a clear communication process to inform customers about the reasons for credit card application rejections. Providing personalized feedback and guidance on how to improve their application can enhance customer trust and satisfaction.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(342, 7, 'Team is totally fresher and don\'t know about the bank\'s portal and policies.', 'App / Online Banking related', 'Negative', 'High', 'Frustration', 'The customer feels that the team lacks knowledge about the bank\'s portal and policies.', 'Implement a comprehensive training program for staff to ensure they are well-versed in the bank\'s portal and policies. Regular assessments and updates can help maintain a knowledgeable team that can assist customers effectively.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(343, 10, 'Overall superb experiance from bank', 'Satisfied Customer', 'Positive', 'Low', 'Satisfied', 'The customer reports an overall superb experience with the bank.', 'Leverage this positive feedback by encouraging the customer to share their experience through testimonials or reviews. Consider recognizing and rewarding staff who contributed to this positive experience to motivate continued excellence.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(344, 10, 'mane idbi fast no staf saro lagyo ', 'Competence Staff', 'Positive', 'High', 'Frustration', 'The customer expresses dissatisfaction with the staff at IDBI Fast.', 'Conduct a thorough review of staff performance and customer service at IDBI Fast locations. Implement training and performance improvement plans to address customer concerns and enhance service quality.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(345, 0, 'Communication with customer is not good in kothapet branch ', 'Service Dissatisfaction', 'Negative', 'High', 'Frustration', 'The customer indicates poor communication with the customer service at the Kothapet branch.', 'Assess the communication protocols at the Kothapet branch and provide additional training to staff on effective customer communication. Consider implementing a feedback system to continuously improve service quality.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(346, 10, 'Opening  of new bank account in IDFC is very simple process Thanks for helping ', 'Seamless Account opening', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'The customer found the process of opening a new bank account to be simple and appreciated the assistance provided.', 'Continue to streamline the account opening process and ensure that staff are well-trained to assist customers effectively. Consider gathering feedback from customers to identify any potential areas for improvement.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(347, 10, 'Good response from executive and smooth process. ', 'Satisfied Customer', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'The customer had a positive experience with the bank executive and found the process to be smooth.', 'Maintain the high level of service provided by the executives. Regular training sessions can help ensure that all staff members are equipped to deliver excellent customer service consistently.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(348, 9, 'I haven\'t received my welcome kit and my debit card yet. Please can that be sent earlier? thanks', 'Debit Card / Cheque Book / Welcome Kit related', 'Negative', 'High', 'Frustration', 'The customer is frustrated due to the delay in receiving their welcome kit and debit card.', 'Implement a tracking system for welcome kits and debit cards to ensure timely delivery. Communicate proactively with customers about the status of their items to manage expectations and reduce frustration.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(349, 10, 'Bank official was very nice person ', 'Satisfied Customer', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'The customer appreciated the kindness of the bank official.', 'Recognize and reward staff members who provide exceptional customer service. This can motivate employees to continue delivering a positive experience for customers.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(350, 5, 'That\' kind of staff take resign from Bank Bank ke liye Kam nahin karta Hai \n', 'Agent Behaviour', 'Neutral', 'High', 'Anger', 'The customer expressed anger towards the staff\'s reliability and the perceived false promises made by the bank.', 'Address the customer\'s concerns by reviewing the communication and promises made by relationship managers. Ensure that staff are trained to provide accurate information and follow through on commitments to rebuild trust.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(351, 10, 'The overall experience was very good. I don\'t have any suggestions at the moment. Thank you for the smooth process.', 'Competence Staff', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'The customer had a very good overall experience and did not have any suggestions for improvement.', 'Continue to monitor customer satisfaction and encourage feedback to maintain high service levels. Consider implementing a follow-up process to check in with customers after their interactions.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(352, 1, 'All false promises, lies, and asking for otp over phone. Your relationship managers are not reliable at all. ', 'Fraud / Misconduct / Escalation', 'Negative', 'High', 'Frustration', 'The customer is frustrated with the reliability of relationship managers and the process of receiving OTPs.', 'Review the current processes for OTP verification and relationship management. Consider enhancing training for relationship managers to improve reliability and customer trust.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(353, 10, 'Indermeet is well versed about banking products and helped me in selecting the right product . \n', 'Satisfied Customer', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'The customer appreciated the knowledge of the bank representative in helping them select the right product.', 'Continue to provide training for staff on banking products to ensure they can assist customers effectively. Highlight knowledgeable staff in marketing materials to build customer confidence.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(354, 9, 'There must be no need to maintain MAB if I do FD in my account ', 'Charges, Fees, Balance Requirements', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Neutral', 'The customer suggests that maintaining a minimum average balance (MAB) should not be necessary if a fixed deposit is made.', 'Consider reviewing the policy regarding MAB and fixed deposits to enhance customer satisfaction. Engaging with customers to understand their needs can lead to more flexible banking options.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(355, 9, 'There must be an option of either maintain minimum balance or do a fix deposit of stipulated amount. For example if someone maintain fix deposit of rs 2 lakh, he must be exempted from maintaining 10000 MAB. This may be raised to 5 lakh FD for 25000 MAB. Rest is OK.', 'Charges, Fees, Balance Requirements', 'Neutral', 'Medium', 'Neutral', 'The customer suggests an option to maintain either a minimum balance or a fixed deposit to avoid MAB requirements.', 'Evaluate the feasibility of implementing the customer\'s suggestion regarding MAB and fixed deposits. Offering more flexible options can improve customer satisfaction and retention.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(356, 10, 'The service of the bank staff of IDFC First Bank is very good. The bank app is also very easy nd  good. Thanks', 'Happy with Service', 'Positive', 'High', 'Satisfied', 'Customers appreciate the good service and ease of use of the bank\'s app.', 'Continue to maintain high service standards and ensure that the app remains user-friendly. Consider gathering more feedback to identify areas for further improvement. Highlight positive customer experiences in marketing materials to attract new clients.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(357, 10, '0 à¤¬à¥ˆà¤²à¥‡à¤‚à¤¸ à¤¸à¥‡ à¤…à¤•à¤¾à¤‰à¤‚à¤Ÿ à¤®à¥‡ à¤•à¥‹à¤¯ à¤ªà¥à¤°à¥‹à¤¬à¥à¤²à¤® à¤¤à¥‹ ni à¤¹à¥‹à¤—à¥€ à¤¨à¤¾ ', 'Customer Support & Follow-up', 'Neutral', 'Medium', 'Neutral', 'Customers are inquiring about account features and potential issues with zero balance accounts.', 'Provide clear and accessible information regarding account features, especially for zero balance accounts. Consider creating a FAQ section on the website or app to address common customer concerns. Ensure that customer service representatives are well-informed to assist with these inquiries.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(358, 10, 'Team well responded for me that\'s great', 'Satisfied Customer', 'Positive', 'High', 'Satisfied', 'Customers are pleased with the responsiveness of the bank\'s team.', 'Continue to prioritize quick and effective responses to customer inquiries. Regular training sessions for staff on customer service best practices can enhance this experience. Encourage customers to share their positive experiences to build trust and credibility.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(359, 10, 'Very good process and great assistance by bank agent. ', 'Satisfied Customer', 'Positive', 'High', 'Satisfied', 'Customers report a very good process and great assistance from bank agents.', 'Recognize and reward bank agents who provide exceptional service to motivate them further. Share success stories within the team to inspire others. Regularly review and refine processes to ensure they remain efficient and customer-friendly.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(360, 10, 'Very good experience and sales executive Very sweet', 'Competence Staff', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'Customers have a very good experience with the sales executive.', 'Continue to train sales executives on customer engagement and relationship building. Consider implementing a feedback loop where customers can rate their interactions with sales staff. Use this data to identify top performers and areas for improvement.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(361, 10, 'Better in branch experience and better Privileges. I bank with HDFC for Salary and I am a preferred banking client but IDFC gave me a standard salary account. ', 'Branch Access & Location related', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Frustration', 'A customer feels that IDFC First Bank offers better privileges compared to HDFC, but has concerns about account features.', 'Address the customer\'s concerns by providing detailed information about account privileges and features. Consider offering personalized consultations to help customers understand the benefits of their accounts. Highlight unique selling points that differentiate IDFC from competitors.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(362, 10, 'Your sales Person RM Simran singh behavior and nature is very good', 'Competence Staff', 'Positive', 'High', 'Satisfied', 'The behavior and nature of the sales person is appreciated by the customer.', 'Encourage a culture of positivity and customer-centric behavior among staff. Share this feedback with the sales team to reinforce the importance of good customer relations. Consider implementing a recognition program for employees who consistently receive positive feedback.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(363, 7, 'I told the bank relationship manager about the nature of transaction i would undertake, even though it was beyond the maximum net banking transfer limit of INR 20,00,000.\n\nNow it is taking time to increase the limit which is affecting my work ', 'Transactional issue', 'Negative', 'High', 'Frustration', 'A customer is experiencing delays in increasing their net banking transfer limit, affecting their work.', 'Prioritize resolving the customer\'s issue with the transfer limit as quickly as possible. Implement a tracking system for such requests to ensure timely follow-up. Communicate transparently with customers about any delays and provide updates on their requests.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(364, 0, 'At the time of opening account your relationship manager assured to convert the account as joint with my husband with in 2-3 days and increase the limit through internet banking to 50 lacs.\nBut more then one week already lapsed and both the above mentioned action are pending. \n', 'Service Delays / Account Issues', 'Negative', 'High', 'Frustration', 'The customer is frustrated with the delay in converting their account to a joint account and increasing the limit.', 'Address the customer\'s concerns immediately and expedite the process for converting the account and increasing the limit. Review internal processes to identify bottlenecks that cause delays. Ensure that relationship managers provide timely updates to customers regarding their requests.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(365, 10, 'Interest rate and monthly. Interest debit in to account', 'Transactional issue', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Neutral', 'The customer is inquiring about interest rates and monthly interest debits.', 'Provide clear and transparent information regarding interest rates and how they are applied to accounts. Consider creating educational materials or webinars to help customers understand banking terms and conditions. Ensure that customer service representatives are equipped to answer these inquiries effectively.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(366, 3, 'Min accout balance maintainance is a deterent ', 'Charges, Fees, Balance Requirements', 'Neutral', 'High', 'Frustration', 'The minimum account balance requirement is perceived as a deterrent for customers.', 'Consider revising the minimum balance requirement to make it more accessible for customers. This could help attract new clients and retain existing ones who may feel burdened by high balance requirements.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(367, 1, 'The agents should be well versed with the mandatory and important details which needs to filled by the customer to get the process smooth in one go.', 'Agent Behaviour', 'Negative', 'Medium', 'Disappointment', 'Customers expect agents to be knowledgeable about necessary details for a smooth process.', 'Implement regular training sessions for agents to ensure they are well-versed in all mandatory details. This will enhance customer experience and streamline the account opening process.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(368, 10, 'For joint accounts ensure that too can be done digitally', 'App / Online Banking related', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Neutral', 'Customers want the ability to manage joint accounts digitally.', 'Explore options to enable digital management of joint accounts. This feature could improve customer satisfaction and convenience, aligning with modern banking trends.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(369, 10, 'Keep a less monthly average limit. 25,000 is very high', 'Charges, Fees, Balance Requirements', 'Negative', 'High', 'Frustration', 'The current monthly average limit of 25,000 is considered too high by customers.', 'Reassess the monthly average limit to make it more customer-friendly. A lower limit could attract more customers and enhance overall satisfaction.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(370, 10, 'Best service for bank staff.', 'Competence Staff', 'Positive', 'Low', 'Satisfied', 'Customers appreciate the service provided by bank staff.', 'Continue to recognize and reward staff for their excellent service. This will help maintain high morale and encourage consistent customer service excellence.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(371, 10, 'Santosh made everything look super easy\n\n', 'Satisfied Customer', 'Positive', 'Low', 'Satisfied', 'Santosh is praised for making the process easy for customers.', 'Highlight Santosh\'s approach as a best practice and encourage other staff to adopt similar techniques. Sharing success stories can motivate the team and improve overall service quality.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(372, 10, 'Increase rate of interest on savings account ', 'High Interest Rate', 'Neutral', 'Medium', 'Frustration', 'Customers are requesting an increase in interest rates on savings accounts.', 'Evaluate the current interest rates on savings accounts and consider adjustments to remain competitive. Higher rates could attract more deposits and improve customer loyalty.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(373, 9, 'Feedback responses should be more than maximum of two options. If customer would like to add more points to rate, the bank should allow it.', 'Digital Process Issue', 'Negative', 'Medium', 'Frustration', 'Customers want more options for feedback responses beyond the current limitations.', 'Revise the feedback system to allow customers to provide more detailed responses. This could lead to better insights and improvements in service based on customer needs.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(374, 4, 'My ask was very simple - Provide me with a medium sized or a Large locker and I open 5 Accounts and maintain a 35+ Lakhs balance. \n\nIf you can provide me with this I can move my entire HDFC relationship to IDFC.', 'Branch Access & Location related', 'Positive', 'High', 'Frustration', 'A customer is willing to move their entire banking relationship if their request for a locker is met.', 'Consider accommodating the customer\'s request for a medium or large locker in exchange for their business. This could lead to significant customer retention and growth in account holdings.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(375, 8, 'Overall good but no any response after account opening!', 'Seamless Account opening', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Disappointment', 'Customers feel there is a lack of follow-up after account opening.', 'Implement a follow-up process for new account holders to ensure they feel valued and supported. Regular communication can enhance customer satisfaction and loyalty.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(376, 10, 'Process and your Executive support is excellent. \nRecommend to other .\n', 'Competence Staff', 'Positive', 'High', 'Satisfied', 'The customer appreciates the excellent process and executive support, recommending the service to others.', 'Continue to maintain high standards of service and encourage staff to engage positively with customers. Consider implementing a referral program to reward customers who recommend your services. This can enhance customer loyalty and attract new clients.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(377, 10, 'Very nice staff, and Clear bank policy ', 'Competence Staff', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'The customer is pleased with the staff and the clarity of bank policies.', 'Ensure that staff training includes comprehensive knowledge of bank policies to maintain clarity in customer interactions. Regular feedback sessions can help identify areas for improvement. Consider creating easy-to-understand materials that summarize key policies for customers.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(378, 8, 'Account opening should be allowed in  the branch.\nAlso the person who deals with account opening should explain all the types of account with all its features well before opening of the account because that will help to know the customer the features and accordingly can choose what type of account to open. Kindly assign more knowledgeable executives who open the account. they lack training.\n', 'Agent Behaviour', 'Negative', 'High', 'Frustration', 'The customer is frustrated with the account opening process and the lack of knowledgeable staff.', 'Address the training needs of staff involved in account opening to ensure they can effectively communicate account features. Implement a structured training program that includes role-playing scenarios. Additionally, consider allowing account opening in branches to enhance customer convenience.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(379, 10, 'Excellent services by account opening staff.', 'Happy with Service', 'Positive', 'High', 'Satisfied', 'The customer is very pleased with the services provided by the account opening staff.', 'Recognize and reward the account opening staff for their excellent service to motivate them further. Share positive feedback with the team to reinforce good practices. Consider gathering more customer testimonials to highlight the strengths of your service.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(380, 10, 'I am really happy with IDFC Bank', 'Satisfied Customer', 'Positive', 'High', 'Satisfied', 'The customer expresses happiness with IDFC Bank.', 'Leverage this positive sentiment by encouraging the customer to share their experience on social media or review platforms. Consider sending a thank-you note or a small token of appreciation to strengthen the relationship. Regularly check in with satisfied customers to maintain engagement.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(381, 10, 'I am trying to register from my mobile but unable to send sms, though i have subscribed roaming.\nNeed further guidance on how to register.\nThanks \nRegards,\nNeelesh kumar\n+[ORDER_ID]', 'App / Online Banking related', 'Negative', 'High', 'Frustration', 'The customer is unable to register via mobile and seeks guidance.', 'Provide clear, step-by-step instructions for mobile registration, especially for customers who may be traveling. Consider creating a dedicated support line for mobile registration issues. Follow up with the customer to ensure they receive the assistance they need.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(382, 10, 'Overall process was very smooth , both executive and relationship manager were clearly explained and the guidance is absolutely on time and perfect', 'satisfied Customer', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'The customer found the overall process smooth and appreciated the timely guidance from staff.', 'Continue to emphasize the importance of timely communication and support in customer interactions. Regularly review customer feedback to identify best practices and areas for improvement. Consider implementing a customer satisfaction survey to gather more insights.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(383, 7, 'This is my 3rd Savings account with IDFC for my family member.\n\nThough I like IDFC banking hence opted for the 3rd savings account, but there are restrictions about using same mobile number for more than one SB account. This is unfair and not practiced with icici Bank.', 'Seamless Account opening', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Disappointment', 'The customer is disappointed with the restriction on using the same mobile number for multiple accounts.', 'Reevaluate the policy regarding mobile number usage for multiple accounts to enhance customer satisfaction. Consider offering alternative solutions for customers with multiple accounts. Communicate any changes clearly to customers to manage expectations.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(384, 0, 'Not interested in savings account ', 'Generic', 'Neutral', 'Low', 'Neutral', 'The customer is not interested in a savings account.', 'Engage with the customer to understand their needs and preferences better. Offer alternative products or services that may align with their interests. Keep the door open for future opportunities by providing information on new offerings.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(385, 10, 'Keep up this illustrative work. The account opening experience, ease of mobile app and interaction with Ms Jinal Solanki aa three are the experiences beyond words. The whole process took barely four minutes and turned out to be the best banking experience of my four decades active life.\nGratitude ??\n', 'Competence Staff', 'Positive', 'High', 'Satisfied', 'The customer had an exceptional account opening experience and praised the efficiency of the process.', 'Celebrate this positive feedback with the team involved in the account opening process. Use this experience as a case study to train other staff on best practices. Consider creating a customer success story to showcase the efficiency of your services.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(386, 9, 'All good. Very good experience so far!', 'Competence Staff', 'Positive', 'Low', 'Satisfied', 'The customer expressed a positive sentiment about their experience, indicating satisfaction with the service.', 'Continue to maintain the high level of service that has led to customer satisfaction. Regularly gather feedback to ensure that the positive experiences are consistent across all interactions.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(387, 8, 'Staff is cooperative while opening the account ', 'Competence Staff', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'The customer appreciated the cooperation of the staff during the account opening process.', 'Recognize and reward staff for their cooperative behavior to encourage continued positive interactions. Consider implementing a feedback system to further enhance customer service.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(388, 10, 'It was very easy and convenient fir me the agent just took my adhaar and open my account in mins \nWell knowledgeable person she explain me deep way... it was grt process ', 'Seamless Account opening', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'The customer found the account opening process easy and praised the agent\'s knowledge.', 'Ensure that all agents receive ongoing training to maintain high knowledge levels. Share this positive feedback with the team to motivate them and reinforce best practices.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(389, 10, 'You have to provide pocket or pouch to keep debit card with welcome kit.\nProvide visa platinum debit card with free charges with account open.\nProvide life time free credit card offer while opening of account.\nOnline ATM deposit facility need to incorporate with 24Ã—7 while Bank closed.\nAny branch cash deposit and cash withdrawal must be without charges.\n\n\n', 'Debit Card / Cheque Book / Welcome Kit related', 'Negative', 'High', 'Frustration', 'The customer expressed dissatisfaction with the lack of essential items and services related to their account.', 'Address the customer\'s concerns by providing the requested items and services. Consider reviewing the welcome kit and account features to ensure they meet customer expectations.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(390, 5, 'Please train your staff as always something is told and nothing happens after opening account. Fed up with this. I might close account too if this continues ', ' Mis-selling', 'Negative', 'High', 'Frustration', 'The customer is frustrated with the staff\'s failure to follow through on promises made during the account opening.', 'Implement a training program focused on accountability and follow-through for staff. Establish a system to track customer promises and ensure they are fulfilled to prevent account closures.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(391, 10, 'Overall, the experience was very positive. Mr. Akshay Vidhate was extremely helpful throughout the account opening process and demonstrated excellent punctuality.', 'Seamless Account opening', 'Positive', 'Low', 'Satisfied', 'The customer had a positive overall experience and highlighted the helpfulness of a specific staff member.', 'Continue to recognize and promote staff members who provide exceptional service. Use this positive feedback to encourage a culture of helpfulness and punctuality within the team.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(392, 9, 'Yes you\'ll don\'t display your offers clearly.\nWhen applied it doesn\'t get completed it gets hanged up on the final process and disappears.\nThere should be good offers on FD I know these are my small amount but it was my start to see what better it could be for big amount.\nThank you ', 'satisfied Customer', 'Positive', 'High', 'Frustration', 'The customer is frustrated with the lack of clarity regarding offers and the application process.', 'Improve communication regarding offers and ensure that the application process is seamless. Consider enhancing the website and customer service channels to provide clear information and support.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(393, 5, 'Your bank is also no exception when providing worst experience to NRI customers. \n', 'Service Dissatisfaction', 'Negative', 'High', 'Disappointment', 'The customer expressed disappointment with the service provided to NRI customers.', 'Conduct a thorough review of the services offered to NRI customers to identify areas for improvement. Engage with NRI customers to gather specific feedback and implement changes based on their needs.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(394, 0, 'Before opening the interest rate mentioned to me was different and after account opening its different.\nI have requested to close the account since it was opened giving fake promises and benefits.\n', 'Account Opening Experience', 'Negative', 'High', 'Disappointment', 'The customer is disappointed with the discrepancy in interest rates promised versus what was delivered.', 'Ensure transparency in communication regarding interest rates and account benefits. Address the customer\'s request to close the account promptly and review internal processes to prevent similar issues in the future.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(395, 10, 'Overall good experience so far', 'Competence Staff', 'Positive', 'Low', 'Satisfied', 'The customer reported a good experience overall.', 'Continue to monitor customer satisfaction levels and maintain the quality of service. Regularly solicit feedback to identify areas for further improvement.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(396, 1, 'Change your agent will help the growth ', ' Mis-selling', 'Negative', 'Medium', 'Neutral', 'The remark suggests that changing the agent could lead to growth, indicating a desire for improvement.', 'Consider evaluating the current agent\'s performance and exploring options for training or replacement. Engaging with customers to understand their needs can help identify areas for growth. Implementing feedback mechanisms can also enhance service quality.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(397, 10, 'à¤‡à¤¸ à¤¬à¥ˆà¤‚à¤• à¤¸à¥‡ à¤œà¥à¤¡à¤¼à¤¨à¥‡ à¤•à¤¾ à¤…à¤¨à¥à¤­à¤µ à¤…à¤šà¥à¤›à¤¾ à¤°à¤¹à¤¾, à¤”à¤° à¤†à¤¶à¤¾ à¤•à¤°à¤¤à¤¾ à¤¹à¥ à¤•à¥€ à¤†à¤ª à¤–à¤¾à¤¤à¤¾ à¤§à¤¾à¤°à¤• à¤•à¥‹ à¤‡à¤¸ à¤ªà¥à¤°à¤•à¤¾à¤° à¤¹à¥€ à¤µà¤¿à¤¨à¤®à¥à¤°à¤¤à¤¾ à¤¸à¥‡ à¤…à¤Ÿà¥ˆà¤‚à¤¡ à¤•à¤°à¥‡à¤‚à¤—à¥‡à¥¤\nà¤•à¤¿à¤‚à¤¤à¥ à¤®à¥à¤à¥‡ à¤…à¤­à¥€ à¤¤à¤• à¤®à¥‡à¤°à¤¾ ATM à¤”à¤° à¤šà¥‡à¤• à¤¬à¥à¤• à¤¨à¤¹à¥€à¤‚ à¤®à¤¿à¤²à¥€ \nà¤‡à¤‚à¤¡à¤¿à¤¯à¤¨ à¤ªà¥‹à¤¸à¥à¤Ÿ à¤‘à¤«à¤¿à¤¸ à¤®à¥‡à¤‚ à¤šà¥ˆà¤• à¤•à¤°à¤¨à¥‡ à¤ªà¤° 11/04/2025à¤•à¥‹ à¤¡à¤¿à¤¸à¥à¤ªà¤šà¥‡à¤¡ à¤¦à¤¿à¤–à¤¾ à¤°à¤¹à¤¾ à¤¹à¥ˆ, à¤•à¤¿à¤‚à¤¤à¥ à¤†à¤—à¥‡ à¤•à¥€ à¤¦à¤¿à¤–à¤¾ à¤¨à¤¹à¥€à¤‚ à¤°à¤¹à¤¾ à¤¹à¥ˆà¥¤', 'ATM related issues', 'Positive', 'High', 'Frustration', 'The customer is frustrated due to the delay in receiving their ATM and checkbook despite being dispatched.', 'Investigate the dispatch process to identify any bottlenecks causing delays. Communicate proactively with the customer about the status of their items and provide a timeline for resolution. Consider improving tracking systems for better customer visibility.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(398, 10, '[ORDER_ID] services given by the staff(RUCHI KUMARI) truly appreciate her knowledge about the banking and product features.\n', 'Happy with Service', 'Positive', 'High', 'Satisfied', 'The customer appreciates the staff member\'s knowledge and service regarding banking and product features.', 'Recognize and reward the staff member for their excellent service to encourage continued high performance. Share this positive feedback with the team to motivate others. Consider implementing regular training sessions to maintain high service standards.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(399, 7, 'Maintaining 25k is very difficult..... Minimum balance amount should be reduced.', 'Charges, Fees, Balance Requirements', 'Negative', 'Medium', 'Frustration', 'The customer finds maintaining a minimum balance of 25k difficult and suggests reducing it.', 'Review the minimum balance requirements and consider customer feedback in future policy adjustments. Offering tiered account options based on customer needs could enhance satisfaction. Communicate any changes clearly to customers to improve their experience.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(400, 10, 'Good behaviour of Sales Manager Mr anil kumar', 'Competence Staff', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'The customer appreciates the good behavior of the Sales Manager.', 'Encourage the Sales Manager to continue their positive interactions with customers. Consider sharing their approach with the team to foster a culture of excellent customer service. Regular feedback sessions can help maintain high standards.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(401, 10, 'Yes, mene 25000 rupees bala account khola tha jisme mujhe visa platinum debit card Milana chahie tha par  mujhe MasterCard prapt hua usme thoda sahi nhi lga aap apne portal par dono ka chayan rakhte toh usme achcha rahata ', 'Debit Card / Cheque Book / Welcome Kit related', 'Negative', 'Medium', 'Disappointment', 'The customer is disappointed with receiving a MasterCard instead of the expected Visa Platinum debit card.', 'Review the card issuance process to ensure customers receive the correct products. Communicate clearly about the options available and allow customers to choose their preferred card type. Implement a follow-up process to address any discrepancies.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(402, 10, 'No Thank you.One suggestion only Add money option i found high amount is there if u put 5000 and 10000.that will more convenient  for the customer.', 'Charges, Fees, Balance Requirements', 'Negative', 'Medium', 'Frustration', 'The customer suggests adding a more convenient money deposit option for higher amounts.', 'Evaluate the current deposit options and consider implementing a more flexible system for larger amounts. Engaging with customers to understand their preferences can lead to better service offerings. Promote any new features effectively to ensure customer awareness.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(403, 6, '1. Ambience and Vibes of Your Thane Branch Looks Very Dull and Boring. It Needs to be Changed to Vibrant and Appalling.\n\n2. It seems that either Thane Branch is Understaffed or that Employees Might Not be Really Interested in Adding New Customers or New Business to the Branch.\n\n3. Response to the Customer\'s Queries were Not really Conducive or Encouraging for a Customer to open a Stand Alone FD of Substantial Amount with Your Bank.      ', 'Service Dissatisfaction', 'Negative', 'High', 'Disappointment', 'The customer finds the ambiance of the Thane branch dull and feels the staff may not be motivated.', 'Consider a redesign of the branch to create a more inviting atmosphere. Assess staffing levels and employee engagement to ensure adequate support for customers. Training staff on customer interaction can improve service quality and encourage a more welcoming environment.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(404, 2, 'Please fix the technical issue so that a customer can open hi/her account from the comfort of their home', 'Digital Process Issue', 'Negative', 'High', 'Frustration', 'The customer is frustrated with technical issues preventing online account opening.', 'Prioritize fixing the technical issues to enable online account opening. Communicate with customers about the status of these issues and provide alternative solutions in the meantime. Regularly test the system to prevent future disruptions.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(405, 0, 'Mujhe account close krna hail ', 'Account Closure Request', 'Negative', 'Medium', 'Frustration', 'The customer expresses a desire to close their account.', 'Reach out to the customer to understand their reasons for wanting to close the account. Address any issues they may have experienced and offer solutions to retain their business. Providing personalized service can help improve customer loyalty.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(406, 10, 'Three days time taken.It should be fast', 'Seamless Account opening', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Frustration', 'The remark indicates dissatisfaction with the speed of service, suggesting a delay in processing.', 'To address this concern, the bank should evaluate its current processing times and identify bottlenecks. Implementing a streamlined workflow or additional resources during peak times could enhance efficiency. Regular updates to customers about their application status may also alleviate frustration.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(407, 10, 'Very good service I am happy \n', 'Happy with Service', 'Positive', 'High', 'Satisfied', 'The customer expresses happiness with the service received, indicating a positive experience.', 'To maintain this level of satisfaction, the bank should continue to provide excellent service and consider implementing a feedback loop to gather insights from satisfied customers. Recognizing and rewarding loyal customers can also enhance their experience and encourage word-of-mouth referrals.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(408, 1, 'Transparency in the process and the representatives need to understand your internal process ', 'Service Dissatisfaction', 'Negative', 'Medium', 'Disappointment', 'The remark highlights a lack of transparency and understanding from representatives, leading to customer disappointment.', 'The bank should invest in training programs for representatives to improve their understanding of internal processes and enhance communication skills. Additionally, providing clear and accessible information about processes to customers can help build trust and transparency.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(409, 9, 'Prudent use of technology leading to ease in opening account.', 'Seamless Account opening', 'Positive', 'High', 'Satisfied', 'The customer appreciates the efficient use of technology, which simplifies the account opening process.', 'To capitalize on this positive feedback, the bank should continue to innovate and enhance its technological offerings. Regularly updating customers on new features and ensuring user-friendly interfaces can further improve customer satisfaction and attract new clients.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(410, 2, 'very poor service i donâ€™t want to continue this Bank ', 'Service Dissatisfaction', 'Negative', 'High', 'Anger', 'The customer expresses strong dissatisfaction with the service, indicating a desire to leave the bank.', 'Immediate action is required to address this customer\'s concerns. The bank should reach out to understand the specific issues faced and offer solutions or compensations. Implementing a customer retention strategy that focuses on resolving complaints effectively can help prevent further loss of customers.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(411, 10, 'There\'s nothing to improve everything is fine', 'Satisfied Customer', 'Positive', 'Low', 'Neutral', 'The customer feels that there is nothing to improve, indicating a satisfactory experience.', 'While this feedback is positive, the bank should still seek to engage with the customer to understand their experience better. Regular surveys can help identify areas for potential improvement and ensure that the bank continues to meet customer expectations.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(412, 10, 'Just excellent customer service  !  Thanks & Regards. VINAY GUPTA ', 'Happy with Service', 'Positive', 'High', 'Satisfied', 'The customer expresses high satisfaction with the customer service received.', 'To build on this positive sentiment, the bank should recognize and reward employees who deliver excellent service. Sharing success stories internally can motivate staff and reinforce a culture of customer-centric service.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(413, 10, 'Good service n fast process', 'Happy with Service', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'The customer appreciates the good service and fast process, indicating a positive experience.', 'To enhance customer loyalty, the bank should ensure that the quality of service remains consistent. Regular training for staff on best practices and customer service excellence can help maintain high standards.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(414, 10, 'If you reduce minimum account balance on saving account then more people are connect with our bank', 'Charges, Fees, Balance Requirements', 'Neutral', 'Medium', 'Neutral', 'The customer suggests reducing the minimum account balance to attract more clients, indicating a potential area for improvement.', 'The bank should consider conducting market research to assess the feasibility of lowering the minimum account balance. Engaging with customers to understand their needs and preferences can help tailor services that attract a broader audience.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(415, 10, 'Everything was perfect and fast.', 'Satisfied Customer', 'Positive', 'High', 'Satisfied', 'The customer reports a perfect and fast experience, indicating high satisfaction.', 'To maintain this level of satisfaction, the bank should continue to monitor service delivery and ensure that all processes remain efficient. Celebrating and sharing positive feedback with the team can help reinforce the importance of maintaining high service standards.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(416, 9, 'Send all terms and conditions, and benefits about  my savings account  that is what are fecelities are given what is the minimum balance required, ', 'Charges, Fees, Balance Requirements', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Frustration', 'The customer is seeking detailed information about their savings account but feels that the communication is lacking.', 'Ensure that all terms and conditions, as well as benefits related to savings accounts, are clearly communicated to customers. Consider creating a comprehensive FAQ or guide that outlines minimum balance requirements and available facilities.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(417, 10, 'Hamen credit card chahie aur hamen do lakh Tak loan kya aap ki bank loan de sakti hain', 'Credit Card related', 'Neutral', 'High', 'Neutral', 'The customer is inquiring about credit card and loan options, indicating a need for financial products.', 'Provide clear information regarding credit card eligibility and loan options. Consider offering personalized consultations to assist customers in understanding their options and the application process.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(418, 9, 'nan', 'Generic', 'Neutral', 'Low', 'Neutral', 'The remark is not applicable or lacks content.', 'Encourage customers to provide more detailed feedback to better understand their needs and concerns. Consider follow-up communication to gather more insights.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(419, 10, 'Less branches \nWhen open account need self cheque require \nMust be open account with cash money', 'Debit Card / Cheque Book / Welcome Kit related', 'Negative', 'Medium', 'Frustration', 'The customer expresses dissatisfaction with the limited number of branches and the requirement for a self-cheque to open an account.', 'Evaluate the branch distribution and consider expanding locations to improve accessibility. Additionally, review the account opening process to see if it can be simplified, possibly allowing for alternative methods of account funding.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(420, 0, 'No service for bank hand ', 'Service Dissatisfaction', 'Negative', 'High', 'Frustration', 'The customer is unhappy with the lack of service for bank handling.', 'Assess the current service offerings and identify gaps in customer support. Implement training for staff to ensure they are equipped to assist customers effectively, especially in handling banking transactions.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(421, 10, 'Easy to serve all process of our account opportunity.', 'Seamless Account opening', 'Positive', 'Low', 'Satisfied', 'The customer finds the account processes easy to navigate.', 'Continue to maintain and enhance the user-friendly processes in place. Gather feedback regularly to ensure that the ease of service is sustained and improved upon where necessary.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(422, 9, '1. Improve your Online process for Online account opening.\n2. Banks agents are not entertain you, if you open your account with lesser minimum balance.\n\nMany other points needs to consider.', 'App / Online Banking related', 'Negative', 'High', 'Frustration', 'The customer suggests improvements for online account opening and expresses dissatisfaction with bank agents\' support.', 'Prioritize enhancements to the online account opening process to make it more user-friendly. Additionally, provide training for bank agents to ensure they are responsive and helpful, especially for customers with lower minimum balances.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(423, 10, 'Kuch nhi sab badhiya hai ', 'Satisfied Customer', 'Positive', 'Low', 'Satisfied', 'The customer expresses overall satisfaction with the services provided.', 'Continue to deliver high-quality service and consider implementing a feedback loop to maintain customer satisfaction. Regularly check in with satisfied customers to understand what they appreciate and how to keep improving.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(424, 10, 'Excellent service for account opening', 'Happy with Service', 'Positive', 'Low', 'Satisfied', 'The customer is pleased with the account opening service.', 'Recognize and reward staff for providing excellent service during account openings. Use this positive feedback to motivate the team and encourage them to maintain high standards.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(425, 10, 'Good keep it up \n', 'Satisfied Customer', 'Positive', 'Low', 'Satisfied', 'The customer expresses a positive sentiment and encourages the bank to keep up the good work.', 'Acknowledge and thank the customer for their positive feedback. Consider sharing such testimonials internally to boost team morale and externally to attract new customers.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(426, 10, 'So far i found the most quickly i have ever opened account with IDFC, but its long way to go as needs to realise how the banking service to customer will be followed in near future that is the most matters. ', 'Seamless Account opening', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Neutral', 'The customer appreciates the quick account opening process but expresses uncertainty about future banking services.', 'IDFC should communicate its future service plans to customers to build trust and confidence. Regular updates on service improvements can enhance customer satisfaction. Engaging customers through feedback sessions can also provide insights into their expectations.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(427, 10, 'You have a great guy in Sayan Bhowmik who impressed me a great deal just by his attitude.', 'Satisfied Customer', 'Positive', 'High', 'Satisfied', 'The customer is highly impressed with the attitude of the staff member, Sayan Bhowmik.', 'Recognize and reward Sayan Bhowmik for his excellent customer service. Sharing his approach with the team can help replicate this positive experience. Consider implementing a customer service training program to enhance staff interactions.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(428, 10, 'No all is well \n', 'Generic', 'Neutral', 'Low', 'Disappointment', 'The customer feels that not everything is satisfactory.', 'Investigate the specific issues the customer is facing to address their concerns. A follow-up communication can help understand their dissatisfaction better. Implementing a feedback loop can help improve overall service quality.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(429, 10, 'à¤¸à¥‡à¤µà¤¿à¤‚à¤— ac me qr code scen problem \n', 'Customer Support & Follow-up', 'Negative', 'Medium', 'Frustration', 'The customer is experiencing a problem with the QR code for their savings account.', 'Promptly address the QR code issue by providing a clear troubleshooting guide or direct assistance. Ensure that customer support is easily accessible for such technical problems. Regularly review and improve the digital banking experience to minimize such issues.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(430, 9, 'The account was first opened in my name and later added the joint holder. \nIt would have been better if the whole process is completed in one go rather than two steps', 'Service Dissatisfaction', 'Negative', 'Medium', 'Frustration', 'The customer is dissatisfied with the two-step process for adding a joint holder to the account.', 'Streamline the account opening process to allow for simultaneous completion of all steps. Communicate the process clearly to customers to set proper expectations. Consider gathering customer feedback on the process to identify further areas for improvement.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(431, 7, 'I have raised request for demographic changes 2 weeks back to change my no. Still its not done??', 'Customer Support & Follow-up', 'Negative', 'High', 'Frustration', 'The customer is frustrated with the delay in processing their request for demographic changes.', 'Prioritize the resolution of pending requests to improve customer satisfaction. Implement a tracking system for customer requests to provide updates on their status. Enhance communication with customers regarding timelines for such changes.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(432, 10, 'It was a nice experience of processing account opening with IDFC First Bank. The Sales executive was nice, humble well-spoken and well-behaved. Thank you ?', 'Competence Staff', 'Positive', 'High', 'Satisfied', 'The customer had a positive experience with the account opening process and appreciated the sales executive\'s demeanor.', 'Continue to train staff on customer service excellence to maintain high satisfaction levels. Collect and share positive customer experiences to motivate the team. Consider implementing a referral program to encourage satisfied customers to share their experiences.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(433, 10, 'F.d ??? r.d na ????? ?? ?? ???? ?????.', 'Generic', 'Neutral', 'Low', 'Neutral', 'The customer is inquiring about fixed deposits and recurring deposits.', 'Provide clear information about fixed and recurring deposit options to customers. Consider creating educational materials that explain these products and their benefits. Ensure that customer service representatives are well-informed to assist with such inquiries.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(434, 9, 'Lower variant should be available for saving account.\nBank can attract even lower level people and provide opportunities to be part of bank.', 'Customer Support & Follow-up', 'Neutral', 'Medium', 'Neutral', 'The customer suggests that lower variants of savings accounts should be available to attract more customers.', 'Evaluate the feasibility of introducing lower-tier savings account options to cater to a broader audience. Conduct market research to understand customer needs and preferences. Promote these options effectively to reach potential customers.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(435, 10, 'In operations services is very good \n', 'Happy with Service', 'Positive', 'High', 'Satisfied', 'The customer is pleased with the operational services provided by the bank.', 'Maintain the high standards of operational services to ensure continued customer satisfaction. Regularly solicit feedback to identify areas for further enhancement. Share positive feedback with the operations team to encourage ongoing excellence.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(436, 10, 'Initially, I had been to IDFC Urban branch,near Benz circle. They said minimum balance in SB of Rs.25000 has to be maintained although I wish to take FD for Rs.5.00 lakhs. Hence I thaught of going for another branch of yours, I had been to ITI college road office and came to know that in Rural branches, the minimum balance of Rs.10,000 itself is sufficient and directed one concerned person of Gollapudi branch. And I could do FD s for Rs.5.00 lakhs + there.\nHence, all branches may be provided with self explanatory note on your bank to improve your business. \n\n', 'Charges, Fees, Balance Requirements', 'Negative', 'Medium', 'Frustration', 'The customer expressed frustration regarding inconsistent minimum balance requirements across different branches.', 'Standardize the minimum balance requirements across all branches to avoid confusion. Additionally, provide clear communication about these policies to customers at all locations. This could be done through signage or informational brochures.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(437, 10, 'Nothing to be improved \n\nGreat experience and glad to have an account with IDFC FIRST BANK', 'Seamless Account opening', 'Positive', 'Low', 'Satisfied', 'The customer had a great experience and is pleased to have an account with IDFC FIRST BANK.', 'Continue to maintain high service standards to ensure customer satisfaction. Consider implementing a feedback loop to gather insights from satisfied customers to further enhance services.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(438, 7, 'Customer care contact number and proper knowledge to employees ', 'Customer Support & Follow-up', 'Negative', 'Medium', 'Frustration', 'The customer highlighted the need for better access to customer care contact numbers and employee knowledge.', 'Ensure that all employees are well-trained and have access to necessary information. Additionally, make customer care contact numbers easily accessible on the website and in branches to improve customer support.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(439, 10, 'Good service of relationship manager ', 'Happy with Service', 'Positive', 'Low', 'Satisfied', 'The customer appreciated the good service provided by the relationship manager.', 'Recognize and reward relationship managers who provide excellent service. This can motivate them to continue delivering high-quality support to customers.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(440, 10, 'Had a wonderful experience with the Relationship manager of Malleswaram, Bangalore branch . Was extremely helpful and guided wherever it was necessary. Very helpful and polite officer. ', 'Branch Access & Location related', 'Positive', 'Low', 'Satisfied', 'The customer had a wonderful experience with the relationship manager, noting their helpfulness and politeness.', 'Encourage relationship managers to maintain their high level of service. Consider sharing positive feedback with the team to reinforce good practices.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(441, 10, 'Overall good user friendly all in one place excellent \n', 'Satisfied Customer', 'Positive', 'Low', 'Satisfied', 'The customer found the overall service user-friendly and excellent.', 'Continue to enhance the user experience by regularly updating the services offered. Solicit feedback from users to identify areas for improvement.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(442, 10, 'It was a great experience as the services received were very satisfying and exceeded our expectations. Special mention for Ms Bhumi who was readily available in providing instant support wherever required. Wish all the best\n', 'Customer Support & Follow-up', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Frustration', 'The customer suggested that information about the 7% interest rate should be more widely communicated.', 'Increase visibility of key product features, such as interest rates, through various marketing channels. Ensure that this information is clearly communicated in branches and on the website.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(443, 9, 'The overall experience is great but I think you should mention it in more places than one where the 7% interest is there only if you have 10L+ in your account.', 'High Interest Rate', 'Neutral', 'Medium', 'Frustration', 'The customer expressed gratitude for excellent service but requested activation of DBT services.', 'Ensure that service requests, such as activating DBT services, are processed promptly. Implement a tracking system for customer requests to enhance accountability and service speed.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(444, 9, 'I am very grateful for the excellent service they provided me. Please Active my DBT Services.', 'Happy with Service', 'Positive', 'High', 'Frustration', 'The customer emphasized the need for timely resolution of complaints.', 'Establish a dedicated team to handle complaints efficiently and ensure timely responses. Regularly review complaint resolution processes to identify bottlenecks and improve service delivery.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(445, 10, 'Very Smooth process of account opening ', 'Seamless Account opening', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'The account opening process is perceived as smooth and easy by some customers.', 'Continue to promote the ease of the account opening process in marketing materials. Consider gathering testimonials from satisfied customers to enhance credibility. Ensure that the positive experiences are highlighted in customer communications.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(446, 10, ' Bank khate ki Jama Rashi kam rakhen', 'Charges, Fees, Balance Requirements', 'Negative', 'Low', 'Neutral', 'A customer suggests keeping the minimum balance low for accounts.', 'Evaluate the current minimum balance requirements and consider adjusting them to attract more customers. Communicate any changes clearly to existing and potential customers. This could enhance customer satisfaction and retention.', NULL, 0.30, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(447, 1, 'Hello,\n\nOpening a Savings Account with IDFC FIRST Bank is easy.\n\nBut after opening account problem begins.\n\nStaff daily calls you to take policy and other things.\n\nThanks ', 'Competence Staff', 'Positive', 'High', 'Frustration', 'Customers experience frustration due to persistent calls from staff after account opening.', 'Implement a policy to limit follow-up calls after account opening to only necessary communications. Train staff to respect customer preferences regarding contact frequency. Consider providing customers with an option to opt-out of promotional calls.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(448, 8, 'Account opening process involved toonmuch time in collecting physical copies and again asking to get different documents which were not asked before.\nIt took nearly 1 week time with so many calls with customer executive following up with process', 'Service Delays / Account Issues', 'Negative', 'High', 'Frustration', 'The account opening process is lengthy and requires multiple document submissions.', 'Streamline the document collection process to minimize delays. Consider implementing a digital document submission system to reduce physical paperwork. Regularly review the requirements to ensure they are necessary and clearly communicate them to customers upfront.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(449, 2, 'Please send my money \n', 'Customer Support & Follow-up', 'Negative', 'High', 'Frustration', 'A customer is requesting their money, indicating a potential issue with fund access.', 'Investigate the specific issue related to fund access and resolve it promptly. Ensure that customer service is responsive to such requests and provides clear communication. Consider enhancing the transparency of fund availability to prevent similar issues.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(450, 9, 'Looking forward for a long time bond with Idfc and very hopeful about the same, your customer relationship is top notch\n', 'Satisfied Customer', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'A customer expresses hope for a long-term relationship with the bank, praising customer service.', 'Leverage this positive sentiment by developing loyalty programs that reward long-term customers. Continue to invest in customer relationship management to maintain high service standards. Regularly solicit feedback to ensure customer needs are being met.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(451, 10, 'It is very good in handling account', 'Seamless Account opening', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'Customers appreciate the bank\'s handling of accounts.', 'Maintain the current level of service quality and consider training staff to further enhance customer interactions. Gather feedback on specific aspects of account handling that customers value most. Use this information to reinforce best practices among staff.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(452, 10, 'All services really good and amazing... specially NetBanking...', 'Happy with Service', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'Customers find the services, especially NetBanking, to be good and amazing.', 'Continue to innovate and improve digital banking services to maintain customer satisfaction. Promote the features of NetBanking through targeted marketing campaigns. Regularly update customers on new features and enhancements to keep them engaged.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(453, 10, 'Iâ€™m very with the service from IDFC first bank bandra west branch 40113', 'Branch Access & Location related', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'A customer expresses satisfaction with the service at a specific branch.', 'Recognize and reward the staff at the mentioned branch for their excellent service. Use this positive feedback as a case study to train staff at other branches. Encourage a culture of service excellence across all locations.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(454, 10, 'Best experience as a banking customer ', 'Competence Staff', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'A customer describes their experience as the best as a banking customer.', 'Use this feedback to create marketing materials that highlight exceptional customer experiences. Consider conducting interviews with satisfied customers to share their stories. This can help attract new customers and reinforce the bank\'s positive reputation.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(455, 10, 'The way she approached and explain the product I am impressed and account opening process took just 5 minutes and mobile app is very much useful and sales executive know each and everything of the product and process. \n\nI would appreciate that lady for quick process and response. ', 'Seamless Account opening', 'Positive', 'High', 'Satisfied', 'The customer is impressed with the quick account opening process and the knowledgeable sales executive.', 'Continue to train staff on product knowledge and customer interaction to maintain high satisfaction levels. Consider implementing a feedback loop to gather insights from customers about their experiences. This will help in identifying areas for improvement and ensuring consistent service quality.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(456, 10, 'Best class banking and good interaction with executive', 'Satisfied Customer', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'The customer appreciates the quality of banking services and interaction with the executive.', 'Maintain the current level of service and consider recognizing and rewarding staff for their excellent customer interactions. This can motivate employees to continue providing high-quality service and enhance customer loyalty.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(457, 10, 'Gaurav is a very knowledgeable person guide everything.', 'Competence Staff', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'The customer finds Gaurav knowledgeable and helpful in guiding them through the process.', 'Encourage Gaurav to share his knowledge with other team members through training sessions. This can help elevate the overall service quality and ensure that more customers receive the same level of support.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(458, 10, 'Thank You Athira for your support in my account opening journey...', 'Seamless Account opening', 'Positive', 'High', 'Satisfied', 'The customer expresses gratitude for Athira\'s support during the account opening process.', 'Recognize Athira\'s efforts publicly within the team to boost morale and encourage similar behavior among other staff members. Consider implementing a customer appreciation program to highlight employees who provide exceptional service.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(459, 10, 'Excellent service , really appreciate it, personally I recommend to my family members to use IDFC banking service.', 'Happy with Service', 'Positive', 'High', 'Satisfied', 'The customer is highly appreciative of the excellent service and recommends it to family members.', 'Leverage this positive feedback in marketing materials to attract new customers. Encourage satisfied customers to share their experiences on social media or review platforms to enhance the bank\'s reputation.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(460, 9, 'I am fully satisfied with the professional approach demonstrated by your officials before, during, and after the account opening process.', 'Seamless Account opening', 'Positive', 'High', 'Satisfied', 'The customer is fully satisfied with the professional approach of the officials throughout the account opening process.', 'Continue to uphold the professional standards demonstrated by the staff. Regular training sessions can help reinforce these standards and ensure that all employees are aligned with the bank\'s service goals.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(461, 7, 'Haven\'t receive the ATM card delivered. I need the branch to readdress', 'Branch Access & Location related', 'Negative', 'High', 'Frustration', 'The customer has not received their ATM card and is seeking assistance from the branch.', 'Address the customer\'s issue promptly by investigating the delay in ATM card delivery. Ensure that the customer is kept informed throughout the resolution process to rebuild trust and satisfaction.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(462, 2, 'Your executive have given me wrong information about the account features and given wrong commitments. After that he is not picking my calls and not responding since last 7 days. Very unprofessional behaviour.', ' Mis-selling', 'Negative', 'High', 'Frustration', 'The customer received incorrect information about account features and is frustrated with the lack of response from the executive.', 'Investigate the situation to understand the miscommunication and take corrective action. Implement a system for tracking customer inquiries to ensure timely responses and prevent similar issues in the future.', NULL, 0.90, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(463, 9, 'à¤…à¤šà¥à¤›à¤¾ à¤…à¤¨à¥à¤­à¤µ à¤°à¤¹à¤¾, à¤…à¤—à¤° à¤–à¤¾à¤¤à¤¾ à¤–à¥‹à¤²à¤¨à¥‡ à¤•à¥‡ à¤¸à¤¾à¤¥ à¤¹à¥€ à¤—à¥à¤°à¤¾à¤¹à¤® à¤•à¤¿ à¤–à¤¾à¤¤à¥‡ à¤•à¥‡ à¤¸à¤¾à¤¥ à¤®à¤¿à¤²à¤¨à¥‡ à¤µà¤¾à¤²à¥€ à¤¸à¥à¤µà¤¿à¤§à¤¾à¤“à¤‚ à¤”à¤° à¤‰à¤¨à¤•à¥‡ à¤‰à¤ªà¤¯à¥‹à¤— à¤•à¤°à¤¨à¥‡ à¤•à¥€ à¤œà¤¾à¤¨à¤•à¤¾à¤°à¥€ à¤­à¥€ à¤¦à¤¿ à¤œà¤¾à¤à¤‚ à¤¤à¥‹ à¤¬à¤¹à¥à¤¤ à¤…à¤šà¥à¤›à¤¾ à¤…à¤¨à¥à¤­à¤µ à¤°à¤¹à¥‡à¤—à¤¾à¥¤', 'Satisfied Customer', 'Neutral', 'Medium', 'Neutral', 'The customer had a good experience but suggests providing more information about account features during the opening process.', 'Consider enhancing the onboarding process by including detailed information about account features and their usage. This could improve customer understanding and satisfaction from the outset.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39'),
	(464, 10, 'Jaspreet & Kunal are very much knowledgeable to provide explanation to me about the saving account. \nI will encourage them to continue the good service to every  clients. \nKeep up the good work !\nJaswant Singh ', 'Happy with Service', 'Positive', 'Medium', 'Satisfied', 'The customer appreciates the knowledge of Jaspreet and Kunal and encourages them to continue their good service.', 'Recognize Jaspreet and Kunal for their excellent service and encourage them to mentor other team members. This can help create a culture of knowledge sharing and improve overall service quality.', NULL, 0.60, '2026-02-17 18:56:39', '2026-02-17 18:56:39');
